WEBVTT

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:01.830
'Mom and I have decided
to split up.'

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:03.890
'This is not my mom's wish.'

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.390
'This is your decision.'

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.000
'Three people
have been admitted today.'

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.230
'I believe they are drug abusers.'

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.750
'That's why I've asked Kamal
to do a drug test.'

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.400
'Abhi, you go instead of me.
- Where?'

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.430
'To the hospital.'

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.590
'The doctor who checked you
has diagnosed you correctly.'

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.380
'What did you say the name
of the doctor was?'

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.540
'Dr. Radhi.
- Radhi.'

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.250
'I mixed cocaine
in the food you ate'

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.900
'because you tried to reveal
what happened at the institute.'

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.460
'This will only affect
your career.'

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.710
'You can survive with another job.'

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:35.220
'If you try to reveal this again,'

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.790
'there's no chance
of finding another job.'

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.970
'Because I'll kill
all three of you.'

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.170
'What happened?
- All three of them are dead.'

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.380
'What?'

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:55.880
'Greetings, people.'

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:58.860
'Today's headlines
are also very interesting.'

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:04.770
'Three athletes who have won
many medals for our state are dead.'

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:05.810
'Greetings.'

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:06.960
'Today's headlines.'

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.410
'Due to illness,'

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:12.780
'Anu, Viji, and Vrinda, who
were admitted to the RK hospital'

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.900
'a few days ago are dead,
and it has caused shock.'

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.050
This has become a job
for the hospital staff.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.770
They are only after money.

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:23.620
They don't care about the people.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.750
We can't blame the hospital
without knowing what happened.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.570
Anything could have happened, right?

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:32.070
'Since there is no explanation
from the medical team,'

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.790
'their death is a mystery.'

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.860
'Moreover, all three of
them have won medals'

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.710
'in international competitions
is noteworthy.'

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.720
I thought there would be a problem
when Manasa came here.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:48.460
Did you see?
Three people have died.

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.180
That's why I didn't support her
from the beginning.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.500
But you didn't stop her either.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.360
Arjun was the only one
who trusted you

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.380
when no one else
trusted you in the hospital.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.540
If they know all this now,
it will be lost as well.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.920
Suchi, what did I do in this?

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.000
I am not involved in this
in any way.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.330
I believe that.

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:09.960
But no one else believes it, right?

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.750
What should I have done in this?

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.500
I can't do anything
in my current condition.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:22.320
Moreover, when Manasa came,
I tried to explain her.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.400
You saw it, right?

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.780
But what can I do
if she comes with a decision, Suchi?

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:28.620
I understand all this.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:32.490
But if people come to know that
Manasa is your sister,

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:34.000
what will happen to you?

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.460
Till now, only the bad name
was there.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.460
You can go to the jail from now on.

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:40.670
Me and our kid
will go to the streets.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.380
Why are you being so dramatic?

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.710
No one knows
Manasa is the reason for this.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:49.920
Let's wait and watch, no?

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.290
Yes, that's what I heard.
- They are coming.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.410
Ma'am, ma'am..

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.680
Will the hospital take
responsibility for these murders?

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.170
Ma'am, why didn't the hospital
send any news about this?

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.120
The CEO is not there.
The chief doctor..

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:08.570
They are there.
The meeting is going on. Please wait.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.920
You are saying this since we came.
No one is talking.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.530
Sir, they will come.
Please wait.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.500
We can decide when they come.
Please wait.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.210
Hey, Kamal.
- Sir.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.500
What did Radhi say
when you spoke to her that day?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.380
She said everything
is under control, right?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.810
Sir, since I gave the
medicine without asking you,

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.850
you are blaming me
for it again and again.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.080
I didn't blame you.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:29.660
If you had done as I said, this
wouldn't have happened, that's all.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.950
At least, if you had filed a
complaint against these patients,

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.030
this big of a problem wouldn't
have come to the hospital.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.750
Go out and see.
The entire media is assembled.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.920
Sir, the meeting is to figure out
how to handle them.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:43.790
So, please both of you cooperate.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.670
I am trying to help.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.580
Let's speak of facts.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:50.380
How should I answer
the questions from the council?

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.570
I don't know.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:54.880
Shall I say that Arjun and Radhi
decided amongst themselves?

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.900
Why are you talking like this, sir?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.040
Then what, Arjun?

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.960
Whatever it is,
they are directly going to the CEO.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.090
Doctors, nurses,
even interns, residents.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.550
They will directly deal
with the CEO.

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:07.830
There is no structure.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.790
First, stop complaining
about everyone, sir.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.100
You will say, Arjun.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:16.000
If I had the problem that you have,

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.330
you all would have easily
gotten rid of me.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.710
Don't talk nonsense, sir.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.790
Arjun, let's get to the issue.
What is the plan?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.870
I don't think we should
complicate this, ma'am.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.890
If we do post-mortem of the bodies
we will get the answer, right?

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.660
But we can't do a post-mortem now.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.250
Parents won't agree to it.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:35.480
Why?

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.250
We can only do it
after the police come.

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:41.390
Not just the police. They are going
to come from the council as well.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:42.750
Be ready.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.880
The consequences of this
is going to be huge.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.780
This is not just a problem
in our hospital.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.330
This is a national-level problem.
Okay?

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.160
Hi, Brother.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:11.960
Why are you staring at me?

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.760
Did they find out that
you are my brother or what?

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.170
Don't play with me, Manasa.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.330
I doubt you when I see
what is happening in this hospital.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:30.480
Why?

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:34.980
Do I seem like cruel enough
to kill someone?

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:37.250
You are here to create trouble,
right?

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:42.940
Exactly.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.330
I am here to create trouble.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.470
Not kill anyone.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:50.740
Hey.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:54.170
I don't have to prove it to you.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:55.320
But..

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:56.690
But what?

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:59.390
This hospital is not just for me.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.120
Many people have motive.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.460
Did they tell you that?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.210
Yes.
How do you know that?

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.540
Don't tease me, Manasa.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:11.910
Listen, I don't know about others.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.380
But I know your motive.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.750
I know which extreme
you will go for that.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.300
Hey.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:22.060
You are talking so much.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.380
Your girlfriend..
What is her name?

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:27.420
Teju.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:31.510
Won't she have created
trouble in this hospital?

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:32.460
Hey.

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.560
Don't bring her into this
unnecessarily.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.030
She won't do this to patients.

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:37.990
Hey.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.040
You are supporting her so much.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.500
I was born with you.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:42.960
Won't you support me?

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.580
Am I the only person
to create troubles?

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.750
I have nothing to do with
what is happening here.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.460
This is my answer no matter
how many times you ask me.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:15.800
What is it?

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.570
Nothing.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.120
Why are you coming from this room?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.520
I needed clarity.
That's why.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:24.900
Hmm.
Clarity?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:26.250
Yes.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.240
Did your sister do it?
- No.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.960
I don't know.
She said she didn't.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.790
I had a doubt on her
from the beginning.

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.250
I thought about it.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.150
She wouldn't have done it.
- How do you say that?

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:47.940
If she is saying it now..

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.360
She wouldn't have done it
for sure.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.120
How do you know that
is what I am asking?

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:01.170
Reena was saying that
she had a doubt on the coach.

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:05.250
If we talk to him,
we might get a clue.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.130
Teju.
Teju.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.420
What is it?
- Tell me, Teju.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.780
I will go crazy. How can
you say that it's not Manasa?

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:11.690
Why?

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.620
Don't you know about your siblings?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.620
Speak softly, Teju.

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:20.500
Shall I tell you in a way
that you can understand?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:21.790
Tell me.

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:24.880
Manasa is not the type

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:27.220
to create problems
like your brother.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:29.320
She is the type who
wants to achieve

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.750
what she wants
in the existing problems.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.280
You have observed it well, Teju.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.390
Come. Let's find that culprit.
- Hey.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.190
This is unnecessary work.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.880
If you don't want, go.
I want to know.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.080
Hey, wait.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:51.440
Reena.
- Yes.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.830
Could it be that Mr. Preetham
committed this murder?

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:57.770
Talk with some common sense.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.000
Why should he do this?

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:00.750
To avenge Ms. Radhi?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:02.630
They are fighting with each other.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.220
They are fighting because
of the concern for the patients.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.320
Why are you supporting
Mr. Preetham excessively?

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:11.580
I am telling you based on the work
I did with him.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.460
Whatever Mr. Preetham scolds,
it will be only between us.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.670
It won't go to the patients.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.420
Okay.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.020
If you see, Ambi is good.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:22.000
But what about
Anniyan's five murders?

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.620
Rocky, that's it.

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.180
Reena.
- Tell me, Teju.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.700
You said that you have some doubts
on that coach, right?

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:34.080
Yes.
I still have that doubt.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:37.510
Since you said that we can talk
in leisure, I too left it.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.040
Come, let's go and talk.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.620
We should not talk
about our patients to anyone.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.700
Yes, Teju.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:45.230
If we go to talk about something
and it backfires on us?

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.420
Shouldn't we know how and why
the patient died?

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.530
Teju, everyone here knows..

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:54.580
Investigation
is your favourite part.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:57.420
But we are not like that.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:58.830
We are poor.

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:05.880
Teju, they will anyhow form a team
for this investigation.

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:09.540
If you find out everything,
they will lose their jobs.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:14.960
Will the investigation team
be appointed directly?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:15.880
No, Naveen.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.520
First, they will come
from the medical council

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.910
and analyse the situation.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:20.880
Only then we'll know
what they are going to do.

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.930
So, everyone involved in this case
will be inquired, right?

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.150
It will mainly happen to them.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:32.250
Teju, are we going to meet
the coach?

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:36.450
No.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:40.040
After you said this,
I don't think I should go.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.710
Amaya, they say
there is a problem at the hospital.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.280
Did this happen
because Abhi went there?

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.910
Keep quiet, Mom.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.420
I am scared, not knowing
what has happened.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.670
You are..
- I am also scared.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:04.460
If your leg were healed,
you would have managed something.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.670
Tell Abhi to be careful.

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:10.220
I will take care of that.
You go.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:11.650
Okay.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.900
Sir.
- 'What is happening there?'

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:33.730
I don't know, sir.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:35.660
Suddenly,
those three people died.

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:37.880
'Why are you saying so casually?'

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.170
'Do you know how big an issue
this has become?'

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:42.140
I didn't expect this to happen, sir.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.540
'Listen. I am not worried
about their death.'

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:48.120
'No matter what,
it shouldn't turn to us.'

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.740
'Do you understand?'
- Okay, sir.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:54.170
'Talk to the parents
and gain their trust.'

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:55.990
I understood, sir.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:59.120
But we didn't do anything, sir.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.580
'Am I there?
How would I know what you did?'

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.960
Sir, sir, sir.
I swear, I didn't do anything, sir.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.580
'That is not important now.
Do as I say.'

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:13.390
'Don't say okay and be careless.
Do you understand?'

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.580
I understand, sir.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:27.530
Aruna.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.110
Yes, Anitha.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:31.500
I need the case files
of those three athletes.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:34.250
Sorry, Anitha. They told
me not to give it to anyone.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.880
Okay.
I will check the logs.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.070
No, Anitha.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.250
No one has access to any details
related to this case.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.180
Why?

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:45.920
You have to ask the CEO
and Mr. Preetham.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:52.420
I am asking to check it
from our side.

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.680
I will double the clarity.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:59.250
If you want, ask permission
from Dr. Preetham or Mr. Arjun.

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.080
No one has access
without their permission.

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:12.420
Okay, Aruna.
Thanks.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.920
Hey, Arjun.

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:35.570
Hey, Arjun.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.860
Why are you getting so many calls?

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:38.870
You are not answering.

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.650
It must be the media.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:46.470
Okay. Why are you not
giving access to the case files?

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:48.930
It is an order
from the medical council.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:51.790
They told me not to give access
to anyone related to this case.

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:53.170
That too..

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.750
They told me strictly
not to discuss this with anyone.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.170
Why do you need the case files?

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:06.880
No. We need some clarity
from our side. That's why.

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.200
Nothing is in our control.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.640
Even I can't see those files.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:18.540
Arjun, sir. They are waiting
for you in the conference hall.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:20.880
I will come.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.930
Sorry for being late, everyone.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.300
So, Mr. Arjun.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:39.580
The death in your hospital
is a big issue at the state level.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:42.120
The entire state is eyeing
your case.

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:44.370
You must be aware of this.
- I know.

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:47.460
The seriousness of this case
has increased, Mr. Arjun.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.150
We have made some decisions

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.650
based on the analysis
of this case and the situation.

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:53.670
First thing.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.290
There are some restrictions
for the people working here.

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.380
You must strictly follow them.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.460
You will get a notice
regarding that.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:01.580
Send a circular.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:02.790
Sure, sir.

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:06.280
Especially, you must not
discuss any details, news

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:12.100
or information about this case
inside or outside the hospital.

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:13.830
Maintain this highly confidential.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:17.930
Sir. I have informed all the staff
according to the protocol.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.230
Everyone in the hospital

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:21.920
will be under our surveillance
until the investigation is over.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.490
So, we need the patient's details

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.150
and log entries
of the doctors daily.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.000
Okay, ma'am.
- Mr. Arjun.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:32.210
You must cooperate with us
until the investigation is over.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.330
Otherwise, we will have to take
serious action.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.250
I understand, sir. You will have
full cooperation from our side.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.160
Okay.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:43.330
But.. Can we solve it
only with the police investigation?

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:46.240
We will appoint a doctor
from our team.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:50.420
Throughout the investigation,
he will solve the case from here.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:57.760
Okay.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:05.080
Reena.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:08.120
The news about your hospital
is on all TV channels.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:09.400
Yes, Uncle.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.080
I think there is a big problem.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.980
This is a very sensitive case.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.730
The whole hospital
is talking about this.

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.960
The police have come.
What did they say?

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:18.780
The investigation
has not started yet.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:19.960
Why?

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:24.210
Uncle. They have told not to talk
about this case to anyone outside.

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:27.580
I am not an outsider. You can
talk to me. I am a safe person.

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.170
Hi, Reena.

00:19:46.538 --> 00:19:47.998
Why didn't you answer my call, sir?

00:19:51.248 --> 00:19:52.278
Sorry, dear.

00:19:53.468 --> 00:19:55.178
You were not reachable
on the phone.

00:19:55.448 --> 00:19:57.298
Why did you suddenly leave
without telling me?

00:20:05.568 --> 00:20:07.458
I was very happy
when I came to know that

00:20:07.878 --> 00:20:09.608
you are my granddaughter.

00:20:11.538 --> 00:20:15.028
But I don't know

00:20:15.688 --> 00:20:21.428
how and what to answer
all your questions.

00:20:22.408 --> 00:20:23.968
Then why did you come now?

00:20:25.608 --> 00:20:27.938
I have been waiting for you to
tell me for all these days

00:20:28.088 --> 00:20:30.468
because you promised me.

00:20:31.768 --> 00:20:33.528
Now you are also talking
like Ms. Radhi.

00:20:33.598 --> 00:20:34.748
It's not like that.

00:20:34.848 --> 00:20:38.378
Sir, I don't know
how you see the past

00:20:38.988 --> 00:20:41.968
and how much it affects your mind.

00:20:45.238 --> 00:20:48.848
But do you know
why I want to know about it?

00:20:49.898 --> 00:20:53.758
Because it's your birthright.

00:20:54.318 --> 00:20:57.588
It's natural to want to
know about your father,

00:20:58.178 --> 00:21:01.808
who he is and what he is.

00:21:06.218 --> 00:21:07.108
But

00:21:09.108 --> 00:21:12.848
what can I say about him?

00:21:15.148 --> 00:21:16.208
No.

00:21:17.268 --> 00:21:18.468
He is not worth it.

00:21:23.668 --> 00:21:27.508
There is another reason
beyond all this.

00:21:30.078 --> 00:21:35.248
Even after having a mother,
grandfather, a family...

00:21:36.708 --> 00:21:37.958
I was at an orphanage.

00:21:40.278 --> 00:21:42.768
There must be a reason for you
to leave me there.

00:21:44.028 --> 00:21:48.218
That day, Ms. Radhi told me
I was born out of a beautiful love.

00:21:49.858 --> 00:21:54.468
Then why was I left
in the care home?

00:21:54.678 --> 00:21:55.758
That..

00:21:56.678 --> 00:21:59.178
What is the reason for hating me?

00:22:01.428 --> 00:22:04.348
If a mother hates her child..

00:22:05.958 --> 00:22:08.098
do you know how that child feels?

00:22:09.878 --> 00:22:11.788
Do you know how it hurts?

00:22:15.858 --> 00:22:18.128
I want to know the reason
for all this.

00:22:23.858 --> 00:22:25.018
I will tell you.

00:22:27.358 --> 00:22:29.888
Radhi was studying in school.

00:22:33.228 --> 00:22:36.388
They transferred me
to another village.

00:22:38.288 --> 00:22:41.368
The family came to a new village.

00:22:43.108 --> 00:22:45.998
I got Radhi into a new school.

00:22:47.138 --> 00:22:51.388
She met him there
for the first time.

00:23:00.678 --> 00:23:02.718
How dare you!
- Leave me.

00:23:08.268 --> 00:23:09.208
Get lost.

00:23:11.508 --> 00:23:13.088
What happened, buddy?

00:23:41.258 --> 00:23:42.648
Leave him.
Come.

00:23:51.758 --> 00:23:55.418
'Radhi met your father there
for the first time.'

00:24:16.458 --> 00:24:19.488
They started talking
only after that fight.

00:24:19.708 --> 00:24:21.408
I was on leave for a week.

00:24:21.488 --> 00:24:22.318
Vijay.

00:24:23.828 --> 00:24:25.738
A girl named Radhi
has joined your class.

00:24:26.168 --> 00:24:27.328
She is my girl.

00:24:27.498 --> 00:24:29.468
I came to know of her
when you mentioned.

00:24:29.768 --> 00:24:32.348
If she is your girl,
what should I do?

00:24:32.988 --> 00:24:34.188
You didn't do anything.

00:24:34.388 --> 00:24:36.508
I am telling you
that you shouldn't do anything.

00:24:39.148 --> 00:24:40.318
Are you scared?

00:24:40.828 --> 00:24:42.008
Though you hit me

00:24:42.278 --> 00:24:44.108
you think I can pick her, see?

00:24:45.058 --> 00:24:46.898
This is not fear.
This is a warning.

00:24:47.418 --> 00:24:50.508
If I come to know someone
is trying to hit on her..

00:24:50.698 --> 00:24:53.658
First see if that girl
is even looking at you.

00:24:53.778 --> 00:24:54.858
Hey!
- Hey!

00:24:59.748 --> 00:25:00.558
Go.

00:25:02.048 --> 00:25:02.988
Come.

00:25:12.338 --> 00:25:13.368
On top of hitting us

00:25:13.898 --> 00:25:17.278
Vikram's saying there's a girl
named Radhi in our class

00:25:17.338 --> 00:25:18.678
and that she is his girl.

00:25:18.818 --> 00:25:20.428
Be silent.

00:25:20.938 --> 00:25:22.398
Ma'am is looking at us.

00:25:24.108 --> 00:25:25.128
Buddy..

00:25:25.378 --> 00:25:26.468
She is our classmate.

00:25:27.648 --> 00:25:29.808
We didn't know that.
How did he know?

00:25:31.438 --> 00:25:32.318
How?

00:25:33.438 --> 00:25:34.498
Shall I tell you?

00:25:34.818 --> 00:25:36.598
What?
- I noticed.

00:25:37.408 --> 00:25:40.928
That girl is very beautiful.

00:25:41.658 --> 00:25:43.558
Why didn't you tell me?

00:25:43.738 --> 00:25:44.858
What are you doing?

00:25:44.938 --> 00:25:46.098
Why are you hitting me?

00:25:46.918 --> 00:25:48.678
What are you talking about in class?

00:25:49.038 --> 00:25:50.138
Both of you get out.

00:25:50.268 --> 00:25:52.658
I didn't talk.
He did.

00:25:52.908 --> 00:25:54.398
I said get out.

00:25:54.538 --> 00:25:55.438
Come.

00:26:02.518 --> 00:26:04.258
I told you to keep your mouth shut.

00:26:08.958 --> 00:26:10.498
Is that girl so beautiful?

00:26:10.988 --> 00:26:11.898
Who?

00:26:12.638 --> 00:26:14.218
Don't you know
who am I talking about?

00:26:15.918 --> 00:26:17.058
She looks good.

00:26:19.038 --> 00:26:20.758
Then why didn't I see her?

00:26:24.288 --> 00:26:26.908
Vikram threw you on the cycle
and smashed you that day, right?

00:26:28.568 --> 00:26:31.228
Then only one girl
would have looked at you.

00:26:32.278 --> 00:26:33.128
Yes.

00:26:33.248 --> 00:26:34.188
She is Radhi.

00:26:34.728 --> 00:26:35.608
Her?

00:26:38.188 --> 00:26:41.238
But she is not as good as you say.

00:26:43.088 --> 00:26:45.098
Don't give too much buildup
for that girl.

00:26:45.358 --> 00:26:46.938
As if you are Brad Pitt!

00:26:48.508 --> 00:26:49.728
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:26:50.728 --> 00:26:51.568
Come in.

00:26:56.628 --> 00:26:57.598
Are you late again?

00:26:57.758 --> 00:27:00.988
Ma'am, I don't know which bus
to take as it is a new city.

00:27:01.088 --> 00:27:03.388
I came here taking help.
That's why I am late.

00:27:03.578 --> 00:27:05.638
You have been telling this story
for a week.

00:27:05.738 --> 00:27:07.698
Sorry, ma'am.
I won't come late again.

00:27:07.938 --> 00:27:10.178
I have given you an excuse
for four days.

00:27:10.428 --> 00:27:11.918
No more excuses.

00:27:16.068 --> 00:27:17.348
Do 50 squats.

00:27:19.928 --> 00:27:20.828
Ma'am.

00:27:21.268 --> 00:27:22.568
50 squats.

00:27:31.588 --> 00:27:32.768
She is good.

00:27:33.438 --> 00:27:34.728
She's not average.

00:27:35.438 --> 00:27:36.968
That's what I said.

00:27:41.028 --> 00:27:42.588
I can't say she is good.

00:27:43.928 --> 00:27:45.228
She is beautiful.

00:27:53.248 --> 00:27:54.328
No dude.

00:27:54.898 --> 00:27:55.878
You are wrong.

00:27:57.008 --> 00:27:58.188
She is a super figure.

00:28:01.308 --> 00:28:04.888
She is so beautiful as to attract
Vikram's attention.

00:28:05.938 --> 00:28:08.308
Ma'am.
50 squats are over.

00:28:08.528 --> 00:28:10.468
Ma'am.
She only did 45 squats.

00:28:13.598 --> 00:28:14.418
Hi.

00:28:15.828 --> 00:28:17.308
Shut up, I say.
- Hi?

00:28:18.568 --> 00:28:21.468
Go and stand outside.
Come in after I tell you. Go.

00:28:22.458 --> 00:28:23.348
Go.

00:28:30.588 --> 00:28:31.888
What can I do?

00:28:32.178 --> 00:28:33.928
This girl won't even look at me.

00:28:34.108 --> 00:28:35.848
No girl will look at you.

00:28:43.828 --> 00:28:44.888
Me?

00:28:45.798 --> 00:28:46.638
Hey.

00:28:47.358 --> 00:28:48.778
That girl is calling you.

00:28:49.208 --> 00:28:50.758
No way.

00:28:50.978 --> 00:28:52.178
Why will she call me?

00:28:52.368 --> 00:28:53.638
That's what you should ask her.

00:28:58.698 --> 00:28:59.968
She is calling you.

00:29:00.218 --> 00:29:01.928
Keep quiet for a while.

00:29:05.698 --> 00:29:06.538
What?

00:29:07.118 --> 00:29:08.188
You only did 45 squats.

00:29:08.518 --> 00:29:09.658
I counted well.

00:29:09.818 --> 00:29:10.798
I didn't say that.

00:29:11.918 --> 00:29:14.198
Then?
- I need help.

00:29:15.258 --> 00:29:16.188
Help?

00:29:17.778 --> 00:29:19.268
I am not in a position to help you.

00:29:22.958 --> 00:29:25.878
What?
- I want to hit that Vikram.

00:29:28.298 --> 00:29:29.908
Want to hit Vikram?
- Him?

00:29:30.758 --> 00:29:32.808
You?
- That's what.

00:29:33.088 --> 00:29:34.198
Let's ask.

00:29:35.278 --> 00:29:37.678
He hit me the other day in front
of the whole school, right?

00:29:38.228 --> 00:29:40.038
You were there too.
- Yes.

00:29:40.318 --> 00:29:41.928
Should I hit him after that too?

00:29:42.218 --> 00:29:43.338
Can you or not?

00:29:44.038 --> 00:29:44.948
I can't.

00:29:46.738 --> 00:29:47.598
Wow, buddy.

00:29:47.998 --> 00:29:49.848
You are saying no
to a beautiful girl.

00:29:51.268 --> 00:29:52.188
You are great.

00:29:55.038 --> 00:29:55.858
Hello.

00:29:57.488 --> 00:29:59.208
There is a reason for us
to hit Vikram.

00:29:59.458 --> 00:30:00.358
What is it for you?

00:30:00.458 --> 00:30:03.138
You fell on a cycle that day
during the fight, right?

00:30:05.948 --> 00:30:07.898
Yes.
- That was my cycle.

00:30:09.558 --> 00:30:11.458
So you didn't see me.
- What?

00:30:12.508 --> 00:30:15.078
You didn't see me getting hit
that day.

00:30:15.188 --> 00:30:16.458
You were looking at your cycle.

00:30:17.648 --> 00:30:20.638
My family hit me
because my cycle got damaged.

00:30:23.908 --> 00:30:24.728
Sorry.

00:30:25.728 --> 00:30:27.188
You are not responsible for that.

00:30:27.268 --> 00:30:30.138
My cycle got damaged
because Vikram hit you.

00:30:30.488 --> 00:30:31.628
Correct.

00:30:33.808 --> 00:30:35.548
Okay.
- What, okay?

00:30:36.708 --> 00:30:38.288
There's a point
in what you are saying.

00:30:39.028 --> 00:30:39.888
We will help you.

00:30:40.408 --> 00:30:44.008
We have to hit Vikram the same way.

00:30:45.188 --> 00:30:46.908
He will get hit.
- Yes, we will.

00:30:47.468 --> 00:30:48.348
Let's get hit well.

00:30:49.738 --> 00:30:50.668
I will kill you.

00:30:51.638 --> 00:30:52.468
He will get hit.

00:30:54.248 --> 00:30:55.228
He will.

00:30:57.008 --> 00:31:00.718
Their friendship started to develop
from there.

00:31:01.908 --> 00:31:03.958
They spent a lot of time

00:31:04.138 --> 00:31:06.138
in the process of avenging Vikram.

00:31:06.548 --> 00:31:09.678
Their friendship also started
to develop deeply.

00:31:13.218 --> 00:31:14.378
Come fast.

00:31:18.878 --> 00:31:20.598
This is Vikram's cycle.

00:31:22.488 --> 00:31:23.628
See now.

00:31:25.858 --> 00:31:26.968
What are you doing?

00:31:27.458 --> 00:31:28.508
I let the air out.

00:31:28.698 --> 00:31:30.558
If you let the air out
he can fill it again.

00:31:31.928 --> 00:31:34.058
Correct.
Do you have a better idea?

00:31:36.738 --> 00:31:38.008
Girl!

00:31:43.188 --> 00:31:45.268
Vikram is here.
Come.

00:31:48.848 --> 00:31:50.228
Okay.
Let's go.

00:31:52.608 --> 00:31:53.788
What happened?

00:31:55.168 --> 00:31:56.168
What happened?

00:31:56.898 --> 00:31:58.588
You drop me.
- Let's go.

00:32:01.448 --> 00:32:02.588
Big idea.

00:32:02.998 --> 00:32:03.848
He is going.

00:32:04.318 --> 00:32:05.618
What do we do now?

00:32:06.548 --> 00:32:07.628
Let's deal later.

00:32:11.078 --> 00:32:12.198
What is it today?

00:32:12.438 --> 00:32:13.428
Side stand.

00:32:17.068 --> 00:32:18.118
Did he feel sad about this?

00:32:21.548 --> 00:32:22.348
No.

00:32:23.168 --> 00:32:24.068
What is it today?

00:32:24.458 --> 00:32:25.488
Cycle chain.

00:32:26.008 --> 00:32:27.068
Did he feel sad about this?

00:32:31.678 --> 00:32:32.528
No.

00:32:34.778 --> 00:32:35.958
What is it today?

00:32:37.068 --> 00:32:38.168
Handlebar.

00:32:40.308 --> 00:32:41.808
Did he feel sad at least for this?

00:32:49.508 --> 00:32:50.498
No.

00:32:54.968 --> 00:32:56.888
I don't think it's his cycle.

00:33:01.698 --> 00:33:03.258
Time passed like that.

00:33:08.348 --> 00:33:11.488
Why are you attacking me?
- Shut up.

00:33:12.878 --> 00:33:14.008
The match is going on.

00:33:14.308 --> 00:33:15.128
What are you doing?

00:33:15.668 --> 00:33:18.768
None of our plans to finish Vikram
worked.

00:33:19.008 --> 00:33:21.348
What we did didn't affect him
at all.

00:33:21.638 --> 00:33:23.638
He is happy without any worries.

00:33:23.838 --> 00:33:26.028
What?
Puncturing his cycle tire.

00:33:26.598 --> 00:33:27.878
Beautifying that..

00:33:28.308 --> 00:33:29.848
Breaking his side stand.

00:33:30.408 --> 00:33:31.378
All these?

00:33:31.568 --> 00:33:34.448
Keep quiet.
Radhi..

00:33:34.648 --> 00:33:37.808
Like how you got hit in your house
when your cycle got damaged

00:33:38.178 --> 00:33:40.268
why should we expect
he will get hit at his house?

00:33:40.788 --> 00:33:42.808
Maybe it's not so strict
in his house.

00:33:43.608 --> 00:33:46.008
Maybe that's why
he is not worried about all this.

00:33:46.188 --> 00:33:47.868
Maybe.
What do we do now?

00:33:49.208 --> 00:33:50.228
This won't work.

00:33:51.728 --> 00:33:56.138
What if he doesn't get
something that's personal to him?

00:33:57.508 --> 00:33:59.058
There is a chance for him
to get hurt.

00:33:59.508 --> 00:34:00.888
You are talking logically.

00:34:01.228 --> 00:34:02.888
But there should be something
like that.

00:34:04.708 --> 00:34:05.688
Who said there isn't?

00:34:06.738 --> 00:34:07.788
Is it there?

00:34:08.628 --> 00:34:12.618
Yes. I will tell you. But you
shouldn't misunderstand me.

00:34:12.748 --> 00:34:13.728
No. Tell me.

00:34:15.968 --> 00:34:17.008
Vikram likes you.

00:34:17.828 --> 00:34:19.188
Isn't it?

00:34:19.338 --> 00:34:21.218
Yes.
That's right.

00:34:21.388 --> 00:34:25.428
So, if we act like we love
each other in front of him,

00:34:26.608 --> 00:34:27.448
he will get angry.

00:34:28.708 --> 00:34:30.428
Oh!

00:34:32.448 --> 00:34:34.848
This is just a suggestion.

00:34:35.368 --> 00:34:36.508
Like an act.

00:34:37.488 --> 00:34:39.178
You need to avenge Vikram.

00:34:41.338 --> 00:34:43.588
That's why if you want,
you can do it.

00:34:43.708 --> 00:34:44.748
If not, don't do it.

00:34:46.378 --> 00:34:47.478
The idea is okay.

00:34:48.048 --> 00:34:49.608
But there is a problem.

00:34:50.278 --> 00:34:51.868
Problem? What?

00:34:52.658 --> 00:34:54.928
I can't act like I love you.

00:34:55.418 --> 00:34:57.158
If you are okay with it,
I am okay with it.

00:34:57.748 --> 00:34:58.738
That's not a problem.

00:34:59.058 --> 00:35:00.618
I will take care of it.
- Okay, then.

00:35:03.138 --> 00:35:04.098
You fool!

00:35:04.338 --> 00:35:06.218
What is it?
- She is in love with you.

00:35:09.088 --> 00:35:11.218
Buddy!
- Hey! Leave me.

00:35:11.308 --> 00:35:14.218
Little by little,
their friendship developed.

00:35:15.018 --> 00:35:16.218
They fell in love.

00:35:18.688 --> 00:35:20.668
While all this was happening..

00:35:23.688 --> 00:35:25.698
Radhi's mother passed away.

00:35:29.848 --> 00:35:31.188
I was broken.

00:35:33.318 --> 00:35:34.818
Totally shattered.

00:35:36.378 --> 00:35:37.358
Poor Radhi.

00:35:39.498 --> 00:35:40.838
She was alone.

00:35:42.168 --> 00:35:43.768
There was no one to support her.

00:35:44.798 --> 00:35:47.238
She didn't have a shoulder
to cry on.

00:35:49.308 --> 00:35:50.288
He was there.

00:35:52.048 --> 00:35:53.918
He was the only one
who supported her.

00:36:15.158 --> 00:36:16.658
Don't cry like this, Radhi.

00:36:17.838 --> 00:36:20.678
I don't know what to do, Vijay.

00:36:21.608 --> 00:36:24.308
I don't even know who to talk to.

00:36:28.138 --> 00:36:29.918
I thought of talking to my father

00:36:30.248 --> 00:36:32.008
but he is broken.

00:36:33.128 --> 00:36:36.058
I don't even know
how to talk to him.

00:36:39.558 --> 00:36:40.518
Listen, Radhi.

00:36:41.408 --> 00:36:44.248
Whatever you want to talk,
whatever you want to share,

00:36:44.578 --> 00:36:45.798
I am here for you.

00:36:46.678 --> 00:36:47.978
I am with you.

00:36:54.808 --> 00:36:56.248
Don't worry about anything.

00:36:58.488 --> 00:37:01.388
'He took good care of Radhi.'

00:37:01.988 --> 00:37:04.928
'At the same time, their age..'

00:39:50.848 --> 00:39:53.638
In all this,
their love kept growing.

00:39:55.448 --> 00:39:56.288
Love..

00:39:57.348 --> 00:39:58.348
Age..

00:40:01.428 --> 00:40:02.848
These reasons led

00:40:03.788 --> 00:40:06.318
them to unexpected results.

00:40:16.008 --> 00:40:17.308
Why do you look scared?

00:40:17.988 --> 00:40:19.728
I don't have my periods yet.

00:40:28.298 --> 00:40:31.308
Isn't it normal for periods
to get delayed?

00:40:32.348 --> 00:40:33.608
Why are you scared of that?

00:40:38.178 --> 00:40:39.138
How long has it been?

00:40:39.598 --> 00:40:40.738
Three months.

00:40:48.648 --> 00:40:50.008
Tell me, dear.
What is the problem?

00:40:50.898 --> 00:40:53.308
I haven't had my periods
for three months.

00:40:56.688 --> 00:40:57.548
Three months?

00:40:57.948 --> 00:40:58.768
Yes.

00:41:03.098 --> 00:41:04.468
Is there any PCOD problem?

00:41:04.668 --> 00:41:05.488
No.

00:41:07.828 --> 00:41:08.948
Is your stomach bloating?

00:41:09.278 --> 00:41:10.318
No, sir.

00:41:10.618 --> 00:41:12.378
As soon as I wake up
in the morning,

00:41:12.458 --> 00:41:13.888
I feel dizzy.

00:41:14.238 --> 00:41:15.838
I am very tired, sir.

00:41:19.238 --> 00:41:22.378
Okay. I will prescribe
a blood test and a scan.

00:41:22.618 --> 00:41:24.318
Get it done and come back
immediately.

00:41:24.618 --> 00:41:26.248
There is a lab opposite
to the clinic.

00:41:26.438 --> 00:41:28.628
I will tell them. They will
give it to you immediately.

00:41:28.948 --> 00:41:30.538
Why do I need this test, sir?

00:41:30.618 --> 00:41:31.878
Do it and come.
We will see.

00:41:38.828 --> 00:41:39.928
Okay, sir.

00:41:55.978 --> 00:41:57.618
You are not her parents, right?

00:41:57.818 --> 00:41:59.148
Why?
What happened, doctor?

00:42:00.118 --> 00:42:01.468
She is pregnant.

00:42:05.878 --> 00:42:07.468
You are here to act, right?

00:42:08.228 --> 00:42:09.048
Oh!

00:42:09.178 --> 00:42:11.268
That's why you said
you would know if you go inside.

00:42:11.478 --> 00:42:13.178
Hey!
Shut up!

00:42:14.138 --> 00:42:14.958
Look here.

00:42:15.158 --> 00:42:16.938
This is not normal
like you think.

00:42:17.218 --> 00:42:18.218
It is very critical.

00:42:18.778 --> 00:42:21.018
Do you think
I don't know that you are acting?

00:42:21.178 --> 00:42:24.178
I am talking to you because
she has come for a check-up.

00:42:25.878 --> 00:42:27.768
Doctor, can't we do anything now?

00:42:28.008 --> 00:42:29.308
She is three months pregnant.

00:42:29.448 --> 00:42:30.508
She is also very weak.

00:42:30.648 --> 00:42:32.088
If we do an abortion
in this situation,

00:42:32.138 --> 00:42:33.418
her life will be in danger.

00:42:34.818 --> 00:42:35.878
Not only that,

00:42:35.958 --> 00:42:38.308
there are chances
for her life to be spoiled.

00:42:39.138 --> 00:42:42.598
So, I believe that you will take
the right decision.

00:42:43.478 --> 00:42:47.098
That's why I am letting you leave
without telling anyone.

00:42:57.208 --> 00:42:58.828
What do we do now, Vijay?

00:42:59.388 --> 00:43:00.208
I don't know, Radhi.

00:43:01.098 --> 00:43:03.468
I didn't expect this to happen.

00:43:04.588 --> 00:43:06.188
I am scared, Vijay.

00:43:07.148 --> 00:43:08.068
I am too.

00:43:09.168 --> 00:43:12.008
But we have to think of something.

00:43:12.428 --> 00:43:14.908
Like the doctor said, there's
a chance for this to be a problem

00:43:14.988 --> 00:43:16.388
if we tell anyone.

00:43:17.088 --> 00:43:18.188
I understand.

00:43:18.948 --> 00:43:20.368
We can't disclose this to anyone.

00:43:21.238 --> 00:43:22.498
But there is a way.

00:43:22.908 --> 00:43:23.748
What is it?

00:43:24.288 --> 00:43:25.808
We can tell our parents.

00:43:26.628 --> 00:43:27.828
To our parents?

00:43:30.188 --> 00:43:31.008
What?

00:43:31.368 --> 00:43:32.628
Did they disclose at home?

00:45:39.359 --> 00:45:40.139
What?

00:45:40.219 --> 00:45:41.319
Did they come home
and inform this?

00:45:57.999 --> 00:46:00.309
What the hell have you done?

00:46:03.089 --> 00:46:05.489
Had your mother been here,
she would have chewed you out.

00:46:11.279 --> 00:46:14.379
She left you with me
to rest peacefully.

00:46:15.299 --> 00:46:16.159
Oh, my God!

00:46:17.269 --> 00:46:18.119
Hey!

00:46:18.969 --> 00:46:22.369
Why are you punishing me
repeatedly like this?

00:46:30.959 --> 00:46:31.839
You!

00:46:33.859 --> 00:46:35.479
Did all the wrong things
and now..

00:46:43.539 --> 00:46:44.429
Tell me.

00:46:45.509 --> 00:46:46.389
Who is that boy?

00:46:48.029 --> 00:46:48.899
Tell me!

00:46:49.249 --> 00:46:50.469
What the hell have you done?

00:46:50.549 --> 00:46:53.359
What the hell have you done?
Is this what you do while studying?

00:46:53.429 --> 00:46:54.399
You put us to shame.
- Appa, please!

00:46:54.459 --> 00:46:55.869
Appa!

00:46:56.309 --> 00:46:57.749
What!

00:46:59.429 --> 00:47:01.649
Let us talk with the girl's family.
- What?

00:47:04.469 --> 00:47:06.259
Amma!
- What do you expect us to say?

00:47:06.729 --> 00:47:07.849
Amma
- What do you think your age is?

00:47:08.439 --> 00:47:09.909
Amma.

00:47:12.259 --> 00:47:15.719
Amma, please talk to dad.

00:47:15.789 --> 00:47:16.659
Oh, no.

00:47:16.819 --> 00:47:19.129
Amma.

00:47:34.619 --> 00:47:36.189
They have put us to shame, sir.

00:47:37.199 --> 00:47:38.059
Sir!

00:47:38.519 --> 00:47:40.209
I don't say
what they did is correct.

00:47:40.989 --> 00:47:42.149
But in this situation now,

00:47:42.629 --> 00:47:44.089
they can't make decisions.

00:47:45.049 --> 00:47:46.109
Let bygones be bygones.

00:47:47.529 --> 00:47:48.859
How to make it right..

00:47:50.729 --> 00:47:52.009
Sir, as parents,

00:47:53.149 --> 00:47:54.029
we must only

00:47:54.099 --> 00:47:55.119
decide what needs to be done.

00:47:55.779 --> 00:47:56.679
Dependent on us

00:47:57.889 --> 00:47:59.179
are those kids.

00:48:00.209 --> 00:48:01.219
Just because it happened,

00:48:01.329 --> 00:48:02.739
can we abandon our kids?

00:48:03.769 --> 00:48:05.159
What do you want me to do, sir?

00:48:05.779 --> 00:48:08.459
They say she has to give birth.

00:48:09.209 --> 00:48:10.079
What!

00:48:11.309 --> 00:48:13.129
What is their age, sir?

00:48:13.309 --> 00:48:14.549
What is their age?

00:48:21.379 --> 00:48:23.849
Sir, sir, please.
I can understand.

00:48:24.189 --> 00:48:25.059
I can understand.

00:48:26.609 --> 00:48:27.469
He,

00:48:28.179 --> 00:48:29.139
let him father his baby.

00:48:29.439 --> 00:48:30.309
What!

00:48:32.199 --> 00:48:33.089
Yes, sir.

00:48:36.639 --> 00:48:37.999
What are you saying, sir?

00:48:43.129 --> 00:48:44.189
At this age?

00:48:44.749 --> 00:48:47.469
If she gives birth at this age,
how will she raise the baby?

00:48:48.049 --> 00:48:49.789
Their future, education,

00:48:49.939 --> 00:48:51.909
there are many things to think.
- Sir, sir!

00:48:52.249 --> 00:48:53.149
We will take care, sir.

00:48:53.389 --> 00:48:54.279
We can take care, sir.

00:48:55.489 --> 00:48:56.359
Let our kids

00:48:56.779 --> 00:48:58.159
go to school, college.

00:48:58.429 --> 00:48:59.299
Let them complete everything.

00:48:59.999 --> 00:49:00.859
After that,

00:49:01.369 --> 00:49:03.189
we can arrange a marriage for them,
sir.

00:49:04.419 --> 00:49:05.309
Sir!

00:49:05.709 --> 00:49:06.599
This is our only chance.

00:49:08.009 --> 00:49:08.859
Sir!

00:49:09.789 --> 00:49:10.969
My wife died.

00:49:12.649 --> 00:49:15.349
How can I alone
take care of that baby?

00:49:15.929 --> 00:49:16.919
Please think, sir.

00:49:17.169 --> 00:49:18.039
Sir!

00:49:18.359 --> 00:49:19.489
We can understand your worries.

00:49:20.279 --> 00:49:21.439
Don't be worried.

00:49:21.969 --> 00:49:22.839
We are here too.

00:49:23.739 --> 00:49:25.019
We all can take care of the baby.

00:49:35.369 --> 00:49:36.619
Everything went smoothly, right?

00:49:37.739 --> 00:49:38.819
Then why did you
leave me at home?

00:49:39.669 --> 00:49:40.979
That's what even I thought.

00:49:41.779 --> 00:49:43.389
But then, the next day,

00:49:43.799 --> 00:49:44.769
no one came
from their family.

00:49:46.199 --> 00:49:47.069
I can't understand.

00:49:47.859 --> 00:49:49.529
Didn't they return
after saying all this?

00:50:06.839 --> 00:50:07.819
What happened, Dad?

00:50:11.549 --> 00:50:13.019
Yesterday, the boy's parents said,

00:50:14.009 --> 00:50:14.989
"Don't be worried."

00:50:15.399 --> 00:50:16.259
"We are here too."

00:50:16.989 --> 00:50:17.959
"We too will take care."

00:50:18.959 --> 00:50:20.679
They were very convincing.

00:50:21.479 --> 00:50:22.349
I too trusted them.

00:50:22.549 --> 00:50:24.919
I went there

00:50:25.599 --> 00:50:26.779
to enquire more about this.

00:50:27.879 --> 00:50:28.739
When I went there,

00:50:29.799 --> 00:50:30.989
and enquired
in the neighbourhood,

00:50:33.539 --> 00:50:36.649
yesterday, the whole family
left the town.

00:50:38.249 --> 00:50:39.209
What am I going to do?

00:50:47.359 --> 00:50:48.239
Oh, my God!

00:50:49.719 --> 00:50:50.829
What the hell is happening?

00:50:52.859 --> 00:50:53.709
But,

00:50:54.329 --> 00:50:56.359
Radhi received a call from the boy.

00:51:02.809 --> 00:51:03.689
Hello!

00:51:05.889 --> 00:51:06.769
Hello, Radhi!

00:51:07.509 --> 00:51:08.369
Vijay!

00:51:09.129 --> 00:51:10.069
Vijay!

00:51:10.499 --> 00:51:11.909
Where are you, Vijay?

00:51:12.949 --> 00:51:15.799
Dad says all of you
left the town, Vijay.

00:51:16.849 --> 00:51:18.939
Where are you
calling from Vijay?

00:51:19.719 --> 00:51:20.459
Radhi!

00:51:20.509 --> 00:51:23.239
Whatever my parents talked about,
nothing is true, Radhi.

00:51:25.619 --> 00:51:27.899
Nothing was said
to support us.

00:51:28.529 --> 00:51:31.669
It was just
to come out of the situation.

00:51:34.319 --> 00:51:35.449
Last night,

00:51:35.979 --> 00:51:37.629
they took me over
to my grandma's home.

00:51:40.599 --> 00:51:42.419
What are we going to do, Vijay?

00:51:42.729 --> 00:51:45.369
No one here seems
to support us, Radhi.

00:51:47.069 --> 00:51:48.739
Let us elope.

00:51:50.239 --> 00:51:52.559
How can we, with the baby?

00:51:54.409 --> 00:51:56.709
How are we going to
manage, Vijay?

00:52:00.559 --> 00:52:01.829
I will take care of everything,
Radhi.

00:52:02.699 --> 00:52:03.589
Just trust me and come.

00:52:05.679 --> 00:52:07.259
I will escape from here at night.

00:52:09.009 --> 00:52:09.879
Tomorrow morning,

00:52:10.159 --> 00:52:11.039
from here,

00:52:11.289 --> 00:52:12.339
we can go somewhere.

00:52:18.969 --> 00:52:19.839
Radhi!

00:52:20.849 --> 00:52:21.699
Why are you silent?

00:52:23.599 --> 00:52:24.649
Are you thinking, Radhi?

00:52:27.329 --> 00:52:28.199
You are okay with this, right?

00:54:11.799 --> 00:54:12.689
Sit.

00:54:14.629 --> 00:54:15.529
Sit.

00:54:27.519 --> 00:54:28.379
Radhi.

00:54:28.659 --> 00:54:30.059
Whether I liked it or not,

00:54:30.559 --> 00:54:31.829
when you encountered a problem,

00:54:32.709 --> 00:54:34.339
I wanted to be there with you.

00:54:36.059 --> 00:54:37.209
If you give birth to a baby,

00:54:37.809 --> 00:54:39.009
you have to protect it.

00:54:39.359 --> 00:54:41.789
I wanted to

00:54:42.359 --> 00:54:43.239
share the responsibility with you.

00:54:44.969 --> 00:54:46.019
I supported you.

00:54:47.649 --> 00:54:48.619
You both,

00:54:48.789 --> 00:54:49.709
have to study well,

00:54:50.119 --> 00:54:51.049
and build a good career.

00:54:51.299 --> 00:54:52.579
And a good future.

00:54:52.989 --> 00:54:54.129
I wished for that and so

00:54:54.399 --> 00:54:55.859
I wanted to be with you both.

00:54:57.779 --> 00:54:58.669
But you..

00:55:00.009 --> 00:55:00.869
What did you think?

00:55:07.479 --> 00:55:08.349
Radhi.

00:55:09.569 --> 00:55:10.629
Your mother

00:55:11.439 --> 00:55:12.889
left us alone.

00:55:15.339 --> 00:55:17.509
You too thought
of leaving me alone.

00:55:18.539 --> 00:55:19.409
Isn't it?

00:55:22.449 --> 00:55:23.349
That boy

00:55:24.209 --> 00:55:25.909
made you wait here.

00:55:27.209 --> 00:55:28.099
Am I right?

00:55:30.589 --> 00:55:31.469
Answer me.

00:55:37.849 --> 00:55:38.779
Fine.
Where is he?

00:55:43.149 --> 00:55:44.189
Sorry, Dad.

00:55:50.179 --> 00:55:51.049
Radhi.

00:55:51.729 --> 00:55:53.019
Whatever the problem may be,

00:55:54.389 --> 00:55:56.149
let us both solve it together.

00:55:56.969 --> 00:55:57.959
But not here.

00:55:59.159 --> 00:56:00.049
Come.

00:56:00.129 --> 00:56:02.169
Let us abandon this town,
these people and everything.

00:56:02.979 --> 00:56:03.849
Come.

00:56:09.329 --> 00:56:10.209
It is all right.

00:56:10.849 --> 00:56:11.969
It is okay.
Come.

00:56:13.609 --> 00:56:14.459
Come.

00:56:15.419 --> 00:56:16.289
Come.

00:56:24.179 --> 00:56:26.449
The minute I came to know
that the boy called Radhi,

00:56:27.579 --> 00:56:29.039
I immediately went
in search of him.

00:56:30.179 --> 00:56:31.109
I went to his home.

00:56:32.899 --> 00:56:33.779
No one was there.

00:56:33.939 --> 00:56:35.459
I went to his grandma's home.

00:56:36.629 --> 00:56:37.809
I enquired in the neighbourhood.

00:56:38.849 --> 00:56:40.939
They said no one was there
and that they left the place.

00:56:42.639 --> 00:56:43.519
Vanished.

00:56:44.019 --> 00:56:44.879
Disappeared.

00:56:46.939 --> 00:56:47.979
They ran away, dear.

00:56:51.009 --> 00:56:51.859
He

00:56:52.559 --> 00:56:53.419
could have

00:56:53.959 --> 00:56:55.629
visited Radhi at least once.

00:56:57.019 --> 00:56:58.029
Just a phone call?

00:57:02.549 --> 00:57:03.409
He didn't.

00:57:03.929 --> 00:57:04.839
He didn't do anything.

00:57:05.579 --> 00:57:07.399
He just abandoned her.

00:57:10.519 --> 00:57:12.899
Did he even think about the infant
that was going to be born?

00:57:14.459 --> 00:57:16.649
If he'd thought for a moment,
he'd have come to see her, right?

00:57:20.059 --> 00:57:20.929
He didn't come.

00:57:22.959 --> 00:57:23.929
That's why I said..

00:57:25.199 --> 00:57:27.059
He is not noble.
He is not worth it.

00:57:29.049 --> 00:57:32.709
When Radhi was in a low moment,

00:57:33.639 --> 00:57:35.999
he was very much supportive of her.

00:57:37.139 --> 00:57:38.079
She fell in love with him.

00:57:38.719 --> 00:57:39.609
She loved him.

00:57:41.059 --> 00:57:41.929
But he..

00:57:43.579 --> 00:57:46.189
We came to know the real reason
why he loved her only later.

00:57:47.579 --> 00:57:48.469
Too late.

00:57:50.599 --> 00:57:51.589
We knew only later.

00:57:53.729 --> 00:57:55.909
How am I going

00:57:55.969 --> 00:57:57.339
to tell you face-to-face that,

00:57:57.409 --> 00:57:59.209
such an evil fellow is your dad?

00:58:02.879 --> 00:58:03.819
How would I say that?

00:58:04.379 --> 00:58:05.259
That's why.

00:58:10.289 --> 00:58:11.159
What happened after that?

00:58:14.819 --> 00:58:15.699
Radhi and I

00:58:16.419 --> 00:58:17.719
left the town and came here.

00:58:19.459 --> 00:58:20.529
After 6 months,

00:58:21.139 --> 00:58:22.009
you were born.

00:58:24.409 --> 00:58:26.579
Don't be angry at Radhi, because,

00:58:28.859 --> 00:58:31.019
she never decided
to leave you at home.

00:58:35.809 --> 00:58:36.759
She fought with me.

00:58:37.489 --> 00:58:38.349
She said she can't.

00:58:38.459 --> 00:58:39.549
She held to the ground on that.

00:58:40.379 --> 00:58:41.839
I only lectured her.

00:58:42.279 --> 00:58:43.139
"Radhi.

00:58:43.539 --> 00:58:45.879
"It is not an easy task
to raise a child,

00:58:46.789 --> 00:58:47.559
"and you are not

00:58:47.619 --> 00:58:49.019
matured enough for that."

00:58:50.109 --> 00:58:52.139
I neither have the support,
nor the age.

00:58:54.919 --> 00:58:56.779
I wanted both Radhi
and the baby

00:58:58.009 --> 00:58:59.519
to be fine.

00:59:01.439 --> 00:59:02.449
And for this reason,

00:59:05.259 --> 00:59:06.669
I asked her to leave
you at home.

00:59:07.829 --> 00:59:08.679
It is fine that you left me.

00:59:09.849 --> 00:59:11.029
At least frequently,

00:59:11.389 --> 00:59:12.559
you could have visited me, right?

00:59:14.639 --> 00:59:16.439
That's what we decided first.

00:59:17.479 --> 00:59:18.379
Then why didn't you visit?

00:59:20.509 --> 00:59:21.369
The reason is,

00:59:21.849 --> 00:59:23.219
whenever Radhi met you,

00:59:24.539 --> 00:59:27.019
she was reminded of the
betrayal she got.

00:59:33.109 --> 00:59:34.709
Is that the reason
why you hate me so much?

00:59:37.089 --> 00:59:37.969
We don't hate you.

00:59:39.179 --> 00:59:40.039
This is not hatred.

00:59:40.679 --> 00:59:43.729
For Radhi,
thinking of the betrayal,

00:59:43.789 --> 00:59:45.069
she was always angry within.

00:59:46.519 --> 00:59:47.679
Thinking about leaving you
in the home,

00:59:47.719 --> 00:59:50.219
and the betrayal towards you,
she was furious.

00:59:50.999 --> 00:59:53.219
All this led to the outcome.

00:59:53.989 --> 00:59:54.859
That's it.

00:59:56.369 --> 00:59:58.049
By holding all this in the heart,

00:59:58.979 --> 00:59:59.879
and being determined,

01:00:02.369 --> 01:00:04.239
starting life
afresh once again,

01:00:05.379 --> 01:00:08.299
and rising to such a high position
in such a big hospital,

01:00:12.959 --> 01:00:14.719
it needs great determination.

01:00:16.299 --> 01:00:18.129
To get this determination,

01:00:20.089 --> 01:00:22.319
she had to sacrifice many things.

01:00:25.899 --> 01:00:27.289
You can't understand my pain.

01:00:27.959 --> 01:00:29.599
I have talked furiously with her.

01:00:30.239 --> 01:00:31.119
But

01:00:31.839 --> 01:00:32.759
more than my pain,

01:00:33.649 --> 01:00:35.249
she must have experienced a lot.

01:00:37.379 --> 01:00:38.699
Because,
even after knowing everything

01:00:40.219 --> 01:00:41.159
it is not that easy

01:00:42.809 --> 01:00:44.429
to avoid it
and get along with life.

01:00:44.689 --> 01:00:46.369
All these days
I was angry at her.

01:00:47.009 --> 01:00:48.009
But now,

01:00:48.899 --> 01:00:50.189
I'm concerned for her.

01:00:51.639 --> 01:00:52.489
But I thought,

01:00:52.569 --> 01:00:56.309
what if you too,
like others, avoid me?

01:00:57.919 --> 01:00:59.559
But for telling me this story,

01:01:01.619 --> 01:01:02.669
thank you very much, sir.

01:01:03.429 --> 01:01:05.389
Will you do me a favour?

01:01:06.029 --> 01:01:06.919
Tell me, sir.

01:01:07.359 --> 01:01:08.569
But

01:01:09.039 --> 01:01:11.209
let Radhi not know

01:01:11.849 --> 01:01:12.929
that I've told you everything
and you know everything.

01:01:13.909 --> 01:01:15.429
Okay, sir.

01:01:16.839 --> 01:01:18.789
Why are you calling me
sir repeatedly?

01:01:20.199 --> 01:01:21.369
I am your grandfather.

01:01:22.129 --> 01:01:23.149
Call me grandpa.

01:01:26.029 --> 01:01:27.299
Okay, Grandpa.

01:01:33.219 --> 01:01:34.099
God bless you.

01:01:35.479 --> 01:01:36.369
God bless you.

01:01:43.849 --> 01:01:45.429
What are you doing here?

01:01:49.829 --> 01:01:50.989
I came in the morning.

01:01:51.139 --> 01:01:52.579
Took a bath, ate food,

01:01:52.949 --> 01:01:55.179
saw the kids
and now had my dinner.

01:01:55.449 --> 01:01:57.599
I went for a walk
and came back.

01:01:57.969 --> 01:01:59.369
Then why are you coming
from Reena's house?

01:02:01.799 --> 01:02:05.319
I went to say hello to Ganesh,
while returning after the walk.

01:02:05.359 --> 01:02:07.909
Reena was there, and so
I said hello to her. That's it.

01:02:08.569 --> 01:02:09.459
Look here.

01:02:10.639 --> 01:02:13.619
You can come here as many times
you want and see your grandkids.

01:02:15.189 --> 01:02:18.169
But I am not fine with you coming
repeatedly to visit Reena.

01:02:19.889 --> 01:02:21.429
I told you the reason.

01:02:22.529 --> 01:02:25.069
I met her accidentally.
That's all.

01:02:27.249 --> 01:02:28.489
Does she know anything?

01:02:28.829 --> 01:02:29.789
How would she know?

01:02:30.479 --> 01:02:31.359
She doesn't know anything.

01:02:32.079 --> 01:02:33.489
Then why are you visiting
her repeatedly?

01:02:36.429 --> 01:02:37.299
Whatever it is,

01:02:38.159 --> 01:02:39.319
I'm bound to have the affection,
right?

01:02:42.989 --> 01:02:44.619
Don't talk unnecessarily.

01:02:45.389 --> 01:02:46.799
Don't think of doing anything

01:02:46.869 --> 01:02:48.669
that would make me
remember the past.

01:02:49.359 --> 01:02:51.729
Just leave it as it is, please.
I already have enough problems.

01:02:51.969 --> 01:02:53.089
Yes.. okay.

01:02:58.339 --> 01:02:59.229
I..

01:03:06.349 --> 01:03:07.199
Nurse?

01:03:07.269 --> 01:03:08.249
Where is Rocky?

01:03:08.679 --> 01:03:10.609
Sir is looking into
a patient in the ER.

01:03:10.799 --> 01:03:12.199
Oh, okay. Thanks.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:03:15.189 --> 01:03:16.829
What work does
he have there?

01:03:17.269 --> 01:03:17.999
Where did he go?

01:03:18.069 --> 01:03:20.289
You should not lift any weights.
You are stable now.

01:03:20.829 --> 01:03:21.689
Rocky.

01:03:21.839 --> 01:03:22.729
Come.

01:03:23.229 --> 01:03:24.029
What?

01:03:24.099 --> 01:03:25.139
Enough of you looking at them.
Come.

01:03:25.329 --> 01:03:26.399
I'm caring for the patient, right?

01:03:26.519 --> 01:03:27.409
Come.

01:03:27.549 --> 01:03:28.449
Wait.

01:03:28.659 --> 01:03:29.739
You are stable as of now.

01:03:29.809 --> 01:03:32.199
Other than that, the nurse will
instruct how to take the medicines.

01:03:32.489 --> 01:03:33.409
Nurse!
- Yes. Okay.

01:03:34.169 --> 01:03:35.339
Hey, what is your problem?

01:03:35.449 --> 01:03:37.739
I get such cases very rarely
and you want to spoil that too.

01:03:37.829 --> 01:03:39.089
This is so unprofessional, Reena.

01:03:39.229 --> 01:03:40.639
Why did I tell you this?
Go away.

01:03:40.709 --> 01:03:41.629
Hey, hey.
Wait.

01:03:41.929 --> 01:03:44.709
Where are you going? You've ruined
my work so just tell me what it is.

01:03:45.999 --> 01:03:47.249
I came to know everything.

01:03:47.849 --> 01:03:48.759
You know everything?

01:03:49.129 --> 01:03:50.309
Who killed those three?

01:03:51.349 --> 01:03:52.209
Not that.

01:03:52.429 --> 01:03:53.479
I was talking about my story.

01:03:53.669 --> 01:03:54.569
About leaving me at the house.

01:03:54.939 --> 01:03:56.239
What is the story?
Why did they leave you?

01:04:03.649 --> 01:04:04.629
The story seems fine.

01:04:05.549 --> 01:04:06.549
But he is not good.

01:04:06.979 --> 01:04:08.589
He said he would, but
never returned to visit my mom.

01:04:09.129 --> 01:04:10.319
So then,
how would he have come to visit me?

01:04:13.239 --> 01:04:15.299
Who said this to you?

01:04:15.639 --> 01:04:17.669
Who else? My grandpa.

01:04:18.119 --> 01:04:19.359
If he had said this,

01:04:19.429 --> 01:04:21.279
he would have said only
one side of the story.

01:04:23.379 --> 01:04:24.319
What are you saying?

01:04:25.349 --> 01:04:26.269
It is not that, Reena.

01:04:26.579 --> 01:04:28.559
Now you know only
one side of the story.

01:04:28.739 --> 01:04:29.779
That too of your grandpa's.

01:04:30.369 --> 01:04:31.239
But what about your dad?

01:04:31.549 --> 01:04:34.429
What happened to him?
Did he come to visit you or not?

01:04:34.759 --> 01:04:36.289
Without knowing
his side of the story,

01:04:36.699 --> 01:04:38.959
we cannot come to a conclusion
with just this.

01:04:40.429 --> 01:04:41.509
Why would my grandpa lie?

01:04:41.569 --> 01:04:42.799
Why would your
grandpa tell the truth?

01:04:44.569 --> 01:04:45.849
Okay. Ignore that.
Anyway,

01:04:46.169 --> 01:04:48.199
you got to know your story.
You are happy, right?

01:04:49.939 --> 01:04:51.189
I am happy.

01:04:51.629 --> 01:04:52.519
Why do you drag that?

01:04:52.809 --> 01:04:54.389
You are happy.
Fine?

01:05:03.999 --> 01:05:04.889
Abhi?

01:05:05.309 --> 01:05:07.179
Did you look into those
three athletes' case?

01:05:07.389 --> 01:05:08.879
Yes.
I only attended that.

01:05:09.529 --> 01:05:12.169
But there is no link between
me and their deaths.

01:05:13.039 --> 01:05:14.719
Then how did you give
them their medications?

01:05:16.659 --> 01:05:18.119
Hey, what?

01:05:18.549 --> 01:05:19.779
You ask as if I killed them?

01:05:20.709 --> 01:05:22.789
Just answer the questions asked.

01:05:22.959 --> 01:05:24.809
How did you give them
their medications?

01:05:25.339 --> 01:05:26.379
Look here, Amaya.

01:05:26.569 --> 01:05:28.119
They asked me to give
them medications.

01:05:28.539 --> 01:05:29.539
But I didn't give them.

01:05:29.839 --> 01:05:31.569
It was Dr. Anitha
who gave it last.

01:05:33.099 --> 01:05:34.749
Did you enter the same
in the patient's log?

01:05:34.839 --> 01:05:36.219
Entering in the patient's log?

01:05:36.379 --> 01:05:37.249
Why should we do that?

01:05:38.409 --> 01:05:39.879
Tomorrow, if the police or

01:05:40.009 --> 01:05:42.089
the doctor came to investigate,

01:05:42.279 --> 01:05:43.889
they will first check the log.

01:05:44.239 --> 01:05:45.819
Only your name
would have been recorded there.

01:05:46.559 --> 01:05:47.369
Oh!

01:05:47.409 --> 01:05:51.719
Even if Dr. Anitha was wrong,
it would've gone under your name.

01:05:52.519 --> 01:05:53.819
You must only change that.

01:05:54.769 --> 01:05:55.489
Hey!

01:05:55.559 --> 01:05:56.699
How am I supposed to know this?

01:05:56.959 --> 01:05:58.349
You should have informed me earlier.

01:05:59.109 --> 01:06:00.849
Did you speak about this
to anyone else?

01:06:02.829 --> 01:06:03.859
I informed Radhi ma'am.

01:06:08.029 --> 01:06:08.749
Abhi!

01:06:08.829 --> 01:06:11.479
If anyone knows that it was
you who went in my place,

01:06:11.699 --> 01:06:14.139
we are sure to go to jail,
even if you did nothing wrong.

01:06:14.499 --> 01:06:15.229
Oh!

01:06:15.319 --> 01:06:16.469
This seems to be a better version
of the story.

01:06:17.119 --> 01:06:18.849
After putting me in that spot
for your problem,

01:06:18.969 --> 01:06:21.689
you blame me that I must have
done this and that.

01:06:22.169 --> 01:06:24.589
I am just telling you
about the consequences, Abhi.

01:06:25.109 --> 01:06:26.179
Look here, Amaya.

01:06:26.349 --> 01:06:28.359
Just get along with curing your leg.

01:06:28.519 --> 01:06:30.259
Otherwise, I would tell
everything to everyone.

01:06:38.519 --> 01:06:39.379
Hi, Reena.

01:06:40.239 --> 01:06:41.119
Come, dude.

01:06:41.479 --> 01:06:44.179
I've actually been meaning
to tell you something for a while.

01:06:44.889 --> 01:06:47.269
But due to the subsequent
problems in the hospital,

01:06:47.479 --> 01:06:48.979
I am unable to even
talk with you properly.

01:06:49.539 --> 01:06:52.079
What now? Want me to dine with you,
go out, or do something else?

01:06:52.149 --> 01:06:53.869
Oh, my God.
Nothing like that.

01:06:54.629 --> 01:06:55.519
Then?

01:06:56.409 --> 01:06:58.879
We went to dinner
with Nilofer's family, right?

01:06:59.659 --> 01:07:01.419
Based on what you said about me,

01:07:01.759 --> 01:07:03.619
I thought you didn't have
a good opinion about me.

01:07:03.739 --> 01:07:04.609
Okay.

01:07:04.769 --> 01:07:06.339
But after that,

01:07:06.539 --> 01:07:09.739
Nilofer said that

01:07:09.969 --> 01:07:10.929
you said good things about me
to Nilofer's dad.

01:07:11.759 --> 01:07:14.739
Hey, don't you have any other
work in this hospital?

01:07:14.889 --> 01:07:15.759
Why, Reena?

01:07:16.199 --> 01:07:17.119
Why do you ask so?

01:07:17.199 --> 01:07:19.209
I threatened you.
I scolded you. More than that,

01:07:19.629 --> 01:07:20.719
I even begged you.

01:07:21.069 --> 01:07:21.939
Even after all this,

01:07:22.159 --> 01:07:24.819
you talk to me the same way.
Don't you understand?

01:07:26.089 --> 01:07:28.019
You want to know why I
said that to Nilofer's father?

01:07:28.899 --> 01:07:29.879
Because you are my junior.

01:07:30.059 --> 01:07:30.939
We both work together.

01:07:31.029 --> 01:07:32.239
We have gone out twice.

01:07:32.759 --> 01:07:34.359
I know about you as a colleague.
That's it.

01:07:35.019 --> 01:07:35.889
Not just you.

01:07:35.949 --> 01:07:38.809
I would have said the same about
anyone working in this hospital.

01:07:39.249 --> 01:07:40.129
Got it?

01:07:40.799 --> 01:07:42.489
Please don't come behind me
hereafter.

01:07:43.269 --> 01:07:45.319
I have no feelings for you
and will never have.

01:07:47.669 --> 01:07:49.409
If I have ever given such a hope
to you,

01:07:49.819 --> 01:07:50.589
I am sorry.

01:07:50.699 --> 01:07:51.919
Please stop this right here.

01:07:56.009 --> 01:07:56.889
I am sorry.

01:08:07.909 --> 01:08:08.799
Hey!

01:08:09.239 --> 01:08:10.379
Why did you talk to him like this?

01:08:11.059 --> 01:08:12.829
He always acts silly with me.

01:08:13.119 --> 01:08:14.309
It is irritating.

01:08:14.829 --> 01:08:15.609
Okay, fine.

01:08:15.689 --> 01:08:16.929
You can say the same
softly, right?

01:08:17.179 --> 01:08:18.329
Why do you say so harshly?

01:08:18.709 --> 01:08:21.129
If he won't listen calmly,
this is the only way.

01:08:22.139 --> 01:08:23.029
Reena.

01:08:23.389 --> 01:08:26.369
At a place where a girl is working,
people will flirt.

01:08:26.529 --> 01:08:28.299
One among them would
want to have a better hand in that.

01:08:28.559 --> 01:08:29.429
Look here.

01:08:29.509 --> 01:08:31.649
Before this,
has Kiran talked wrongly with you?

01:08:32.829 --> 01:08:33.849
Or has he misbehaved with you?

01:08:35.879 --> 01:08:37.979
No.
- Then why speak to him so rudely?

01:08:39.869 --> 01:08:41.309
Can I tell you something?
- No.

01:08:41.839 --> 01:08:42.569
Reena?

01:08:42.649 --> 01:08:44.599
It's on the tip of my tongue,
let me say it.

01:08:44.659 --> 01:08:45.579
Then why do you ask?

01:08:45.729 --> 01:08:46.599
Tell me.

01:08:47.539 --> 01:08:48.689
I feel that,

01:08:49.069 --> 01:08:49.959
more than Arjun,

01:08:50.579 --> 01:08:51.769
Kiran is a better choice.

01:08:51.999 --> 01:08:53.469
You!

01:08:53.569 --> 01:08:55.629
Reena, Reena, both are average.

01:08:55.689 --> 01:08:57.889
Why are you saying this?
I am going to beat you up.

01:09:10.699 --> 01:09:11.559
Hi!

01:09:13.699 --> 01:09:14.579
Hey, Kiran?

01:09:15.159 --> 01:09:16.019
What happened?

01:09:18.139 --> 01:09:19.009
Kiran?

01:09:20.339 --> 01:09:22.229
You truly don't like me
and Reena joining together, right?

01:09:22.649 --> 01:09:23.309
Hey!

01:09:23.419 --> 01:09:24.159
What, dude?

01:09:24.239 --> 01:09:25.099
You are blabbering like an idiot.

01:09:26.419 --> 01:09:27.299
Why wouldn't you say so?

01:09:28.279 --> 01:09:29.179
I trusted you.

01:09:30.319 --> 01:09:31.209
I deserve this.

01:09:32.299 --> 01:09:33.159
Hey, Kiran!

01:09:33.919 --> 01:09:35.009
Tell me clearly.

01:09:36.849 --> 01:09:39.319
Only because you said Reena
likes me, I spoke with her.

01:09:40.539 --> 01:09:41.849
When I asked,
do you know what she said?

01:09:43.089 --> 01:09:44.319
She said
we both are just colleagues.

01:09:45.669 --> 01:09:47.039
She doesn't have any feelings
towards me, it seems.

01:09:49.389 --> 01:09:50.249
Kiran.

01:09:50.329 --> 01:09:52.879
What am I to do for her saying so?
- Don't talk, Nilofer.

01:09:53.129 --> 01:09:55.089
I would have done something
to impress her in a few days.

01:09:55.819 --> 01:09:56.859
But I listened to you, right?

01:09:57.779 --> 01:09:59.469
I deserve this.
- Hey, Kiran.

01:09:59.729 --> 01:10:00.599
Look here.

01:10:00.779 --> 01:10:02.269
If she doesn't like you,
then it is a fact.

01:10:02.769 --> 01:10:04.539
Whenever you ask her,
her reply is not going to change.

01:10:04.849 --> 01:10:06.359
Creating expectations
unnecessarily was your mistake.

01:10:06.429 --> 01:10:07.759
Always talk negatively like this.

01:10:07.909 --> 01:10:08.829
She must not like me.

01:10:08.929 --> 01:10:09.859
That's what you want, right?

01:10:10.409 --> 01:10:12.509
Hey, had I thought so,

01:10:12.569 --> 01:10:13.789
I would not have helped you
in setting up your dates.

01:10:14.139 --> 01:10:15.019
Not just that,

01:10:15.209 --> 01:10:16.599
I wouldn't have said,

01:10:16.639 --> 01:10:17.489
what Reena talked about you
to my dad.

01:10:17.549 --> 01:10:18.519
Don't talk unnecessarily, Nilofer.

01:10:19.199 --> 01:10:20.889
Just by talking like this,
you spoiled everything.

01:10:23.469 --> 01:10:24.779
You're overreacting, Kiran.

01:10:25.159 --> 01:10:25.949
Hey!

01:10:25.999 --> 01:10:27.139
I might say something bad
out of fury.

01:10:27.379 --> 01:10:28.239
You will talk, it seems.

01:10:28.769 --> 01:10:30.179
I know about you very well.

01:10:31.099 --> 01:10:32.929
What do you know of me?
What do you know?

01:10:33.499 --> 01:10:34.349
Don't you feel ashamed?

01:10:35.239 --> 01:10:36.889
Even after she said repeatedly,
you are going after her.

01:10:37.169 --> 01:10:38.729
Aren't you ashamed?
- I?

01:10:39.049 --> 01:10:39.959
Don't you feel ashamed?

01:10:40.179 --> 01:10:42.009
Why should I?
- You are coming after me.

01:10:43.009 --> 01:10:43.889
You like me.

01:10:44.379 --> 01:10:45.359
So Reena must not attain me.

01:10:46.169 --> 01:10:47.019
Not just that.

01:10:47.109 --> 01:10:48.979
You said you loved me
to stop the engagement.

01:10:49.259 --> 01:10:50.189
Did you stop with that?

01:10:50.439 --> 01:10:51.629
You brought your
father the next day

01:10:51.729 --> 01:10:52.829
and you thought of hooking
with me.

01:10:54.309 --> 01:10:55.649
Now, Reena also said
she doesn't like me.

01:10:56.409 --> 01:10:57.269
Are you happy?

01:10:58.079 --> 01:10:58.969
You solved all your
personal problems

01:10:59.309 --> 01:11:01.049
by having me, right?

01:11:03.209 --> 01:11:04.579
You're overreacting, Kiran.

01:11:04.859 --> 01:11:05.619
I have already said

01:11:05.679 --> 01:11:07.529
I don't have
any feelings towards you, right?

01:11:08.049 --> 01:11:08.769
But still,

01:11:08.829 --> 01:11:09.899
you are coming after me.

01:11:10.089 --> 01:11:11.279
Aren't you ashamed?

01:11:14.509 --> 01:11:16.529
If you say a word
more than this..

01:11:30.869 --> 01:11:32.249
Who are you?
What do you want?

01:11:32.469 --> 01:11:33.409
I am Kamal.

01:11:33.649 --> 01:11:34.559
Amaya's colleague.

01:11:34.839 --> 01:11:36.109
We work together.

01:11:36.409 --> 01:11:37.949
Can I see Amaya?

01:11:38.729 --> 01:11:39.619
Amaya is not at home.

01:11:40.129 --> 01:11:41.039
Who is that, Mom?

01:11:42.099 --> 01:11:44.189
I hear Amaya's voice.
But you say she is not home.

01:11:44.289 --> 01:11:45.169
Can I meet her?

01:11:45.349 --> 01:11:46.079
Amaya!

01:11:46.179 --> 01:11:47.739
Didn't you tell your mom
about me?

01:11:47.809 --> 01:11:49.599
Without knowing about me,
she said you are not home.

01:11:50.119 --> 01:11:51.079
But then,

01:11:51.399 --> 01:11:53.399
like you said, I checked the log.

01:11:53.519 --> 01:11:54.379
Amma, coffee.

01:11:54.709 --> 01:11:56.259
Anitha's name is not in that.

01:11:56.399 --> 01:11:57.659
It is your name at the end.

01:11:58.029 --> 01:11:59.949
A new doctor is going to arrive
for investigation.

01:11:59.989 --> 01:12:01.649
Won't he catch you if he sees that?

01:12:02.139 --> 01:12:03.349
Tell me everything correctly.

01:12:03.619 --> 01:12:05.049
You didn't give any
wrong medicines, right?

01:12:05.769 --> 01:12:06.809
I didn't do anything.

01:12:07.639 --> 01:12:08.949
I gave what they asked me to give.

01:12:09.679 --> 01:12:10.639
Am I a doctor

01:12:11.029 --> 01:12:13.529
to give medicines on my own?
- I know you won't.

01:12:14.839 --> 01:12:15.739
Oh, my God.

01:12:16.309 --> 01:12:17.159
What is this?

01:12:17.609 --> 01:12:19.379
You were fine yesterday.
Is it a fracture?

01:12:19.579 --> 01:12:20.469
Show me your leg.

01:12:21.309 --> 01:12:22.189
What happened?

01:12:22.439 --> 01:12:23.539
W-Well..

01:12:23.989 --> 01:12:25.979
On my way back, I got hurt.

01:12:26.919 --> 01:12:28.569
It doesn't seem like a bandage
dressed on the way.

01:12:28.729 --> 01:12:30.709
Seems it was dressed a week ago.
- Nothing would stay in place.

01:12:30.749 --> 01:12:32.189
Did you get hurt in the ankle?

01:12:32.309 --> 01:12:32.819
Hey, Amaya!

01:12:32.889 --> 01:12:33.769
Where is the ID?

01:12:34.689 --> 01:12:35.799
Hi, Amaya!
- Hi!

01:12:36.439 --> 01:12:37.299
Oh!

01:12:44.019 --> 01:12:45.219
Oh, my God!

01:12:50.849 --> 01:12:51.729
Everything is ruined.

01:15:06.548 --> 01:15:10.698
If Amaya is here,
then who came to the hospital?

01:15:11.308 --> 01:15:13.878
I don't know, let me ask.
Amaya?

01:15:15.048 --> 01:15:17.818
Amaya? Am..

01:15:18.788 --> 01:15:20.158
Who is Amaya now?

01:15:22.848 --> 01:15:24.338
Are you showing
the film Jeans here?

01:15:24.958 --> 01:15:29.018
Both of you are here.
How long has this been going on?

01:15:29.098 --> 01:15:33.338
Just a few days.
- Are you kidding me?

01:15:33.408 --> 01:15:36.118
Do you know how big this matter is?

01:15:36.568 --> 01:15:40.538
If people find out..
That too for the hospital problems..

01:15:41.988 --> 01:15:44.248
No, it's for the salary.

01:15:44.308 --> 01:15:46.598
If salary was the problem,
I would have done something.

01:15:46.888 --> 01:15:49.488
Yes, you are not even earning
that much.

01:15:49.548 --> 01:15:52.368
Even if I couldn't,
I would have arranged something.

01:15:53.338 --> 01:15:54.868
That's all okay.

01:15:55.008 --> 01:15:59.868
I have a doubt. If you get caught,
which of you two will go to jail?

01:16:00.228 --> 01:16:01.678
There is no chance
of getting caught.

01:16:02.448 --> 01:16:03.828
As if that will happen for real.

01:16:03.888 --> 01:16:06.728
I had a doubt when she called me
without respect.

01:16:06.808 --> 01:16:10.208
I didn't notice that.
- Kamal, can you do me a favour?

01:16:11.098 --> 01:16:12.438
What is it? Amaya.

01:16:13.398 --> 01:16:15.168
Abhi doesn't know anything.

01:16:15.498 --> 01:16:18.598
Can you take care of her
in the hospital for a few days?

01:16:19.598 --> 01:16:21.018
I'm saying that this is wrong.

01:16:21.078 --> 01:16:22.968
You are asking me
to be an accomplice with you.

01:16:25.408 --> 01:16:29.368
Please, Kamal, I don't know
what to do, and I am helpless.

01:16:30.518 --> 01:16:33.808
I have no other choice
but to ask you.

01:16:35.728 --> 01:16:37.678
There are a lot of problems
in this, Amaya.

01:16:37.748 --> 01:16:39.678
I don't know what to do.

01:16:42.108 --> 01:16:43.748
Take care for a few days, Kamal.

01:16:43.998 --> 01:16:46.908
I'll come to the hospital
as soon as my leg is healed.

01:16:47.488 --> 01:16:48.528
Please, Kamal.

01:16:49.118 --> 01:16:50.928
Do this for my sake.

01:16:51.548 --> 01:16:54.618
Hey, Amaya. Am I managing all these
days without knowing anything?

01:16:54.658 --> 01:16:56.638
I don't need his help,
I will take care.

01:16:57.688 --> 01:17:02.528
Did you see? You are brave enough.
Until you go to jail.

01:17:03.338 --> 01:17:06.878
Look, Amaya. I can't run
this drama for a long time.

01:17:07.288 --> 01:17:12.088
If you want, I can do something
internally, for a few days.

01:17:13.418 --> 01:17:14.448
Thanks, Kamal.

01:17:27.608 --> 01:17:29.228
Why are all the board members
here today?

01:17:29.618 --> 01:17:31.458
No one told me
about the board meeting.

01:17:32.088 --> 01:17:33.498
And I didn't invite anyone.

01:17:35.648 --> 01:17:36.938
I invited everyone.

01:17:42.098 --> 01:17:43.108
Why, sir?

01:17:44.508 --> 01:17:46.678
When there is a critical situation
in the hospital,

01:17:47.168 --> 01:17:48.488
I can summon the board members.

01:17:49.118 --> 01:17:52.418
I have that power.
- I didn't ask about your power.

01:17:53.348 --> 01:17:55.398
I asked why you had invited
everyone.

01:17:56.378 --> 01:17:57.638
Everyone in this hospital,

01:17:57.718 --> 01:17:59.978
without following
the chief doctor's orders

01:18:00.618 --> 01:18:02.498
they are creating several problems.

01:18:03.168 --> 01:18:04.468
The board members
should know about it.

01:18:04.538 --> 01:18:05.538
Sir.

01:18:06.438 --> 01:18:08.828
I have already explained
this to you.

01:18:08.948 --> 01:18:11.918
Radhi ma'am discussed with me
before deciding it.

01:18:11.978 --> 01:18:13.598
Without speaking
to the chief doctor,

01:18:13.658 --> 01:18:15.448
why did she discuss it with you?

01:18:15.658 --> 01:18:20.518
And then before deciding, why didn't
you discuss with the chief doctor?

01:18:20.798 --> 01:18:23.238
She is asking you, Arjun.
Please tell her.

01:18:25.208 --> 01:18:26.218
I will tell you, ma'am.

01:18:26.558 --> 01:18:28.248
Arjun believes everyone blindly.

01:18:28.898 --> 01:18:30.428
So he wants to support everyone.

01:18:31.538 --> 01:18:33.928
For a CEO who runs such
a big hospital,

01:18:33.998 --> 01:18:35.808
this is not a good quality to have.

01:18:37.408 --> 01:18:38.688
What are you trying to say, sir?

01:18:40.168 --> 01:18:41.928
I think we should change the CEO.

01:18:43.008 --> 01:18:44.008
Sir.

01:18:45.188 --> 01:18:47.108
I am the one
who brought you to this hospital.

01:18:47.298 --> 01:18:48.298
Correct.

01:18:49.188 --> 01:18:51.178
But you appointed me
for this hospital.

01:18:51.538 --> 01:18:53.418
So, if there is a problem,

01:18:53.988 --> 01:18:55.998
I can only take
the hospital's side.

01:18:57.668 --> 01:19:00.708
But you know that I'm the CEO
till this second, right?

01:19:00.758 --> 01:19:01.938
Of course I know that.

01:19:02.968 --> 01:19:03.968
Then,

01:19:05.078 --> 01:19:07.208
even if I think about it now,
I can dismiss you, right?

01:19:07.248 --> 01:19:08.508
No, no, no.

01:19:08.688 --> 01:19:09.698
That's not possible now.

01:19:10.248 --> 01:19:13.318
You see, as per protocol,
till this case is solved

01:19:13.408 --> 01:19:16.968
you can't dismiss anyone, Arjun.
- Sir.

01:19:17.038 --> 01:19:20.898
Arjun, Dr. Preetham is right.
We agree to the point

01:19:20.968 --> 01:19:23.998
For the complaint raised
against you by Dr. Preetham,

01:19:24.068 --> 01:19:26.938
you have to give an answer.
- Sorry to interrupt.

01:19:28.388 --> 01:19:30.098
As the coach asked,

01:19:30.158 --> 01:19:33.608
I only requested
Arjun not to tell this to anyone.

01:19:33.678 --> 01:19:34.568
I understand.

01:19:34.688 --> 01:19:38.358
But why didn't you handle
this through our chief doctor?

01:19:39.838 --> 01:19:43.348
Sir, all this seems to me like
targeting Arjun.

01:19:43.618 --> 01:19:45.908
There is already an issue going on.

01:19:46.108 --> 01:19:51.808
Until it is solved, it is better to
hold the complaint against Arjun.

01:19:52.418 --> 01:19:54.448
I think we can wait.

01:19:55.038 --> 01:19:56.038
Preetham sir.

01:19:56.788 --> 01:20:00.408
Don't use your power
and this situation as an advantage.

01:20:00.588 --> 01:20:01.588
Please.

01:20:03.118 --> 01:20:04.098
It's okay, Arjun.

01:20:04.158 --> 01:20:06.468
We will talk about it
after this case is over.

01:20:07.038 --> 01:20:08.038
Sure.

01:20:12.808 --> 01:20:13.808
Kiran.

01:20:14.568 --> 01:20:15.578
Get up.

01:20:16.588 --> 01:20:18.108
For what?
- Get up and come with me.

01:20:19.228 --> 01:20:20.758
You have beaten me.

01:20:21.608 --> 01:20:23.818
Now what?
Are you trying to convince me?

01:20:23.888 --> 01:20:27.098
No one is here to convince you.
Get up and come with me.

01:20:27.688 --> 01:20:29.498
I can't come.
- Hey, come.

01:20:29.558 --> 01:20:30.568
Hey.

01:20:31.968 --> 01:20:33.068
Hey, leave me.

01:20:34.638 --> 01:20:35.968
Why did you bring me here?

01:20:40.888 --> 01:20:41.888
Who is he?

01:20:42.158 --> 01:20:48.008
Vinodh. He was my boyfriend.
- Did you break up?

01:20:50.538 --> 01:20:51.538
Then?

01:20:53.298 --> 01:20:55.468
He died in a bike accident.

01:20:58.348 --> 01:21:01.048
You look like him.

01:21:01.518 --> 01:21:02.758
Not just the looks.

01:21:03.428 --> 01:21:06.898
Everything you say
and do is like him.

01:21:07.158 --> 01:21:10.608
That's why I got close to you
unknowingly.

01:21:13.978 --> 01:21:14.978
This is the reason.

01:21:15.208 --> 01:21:17.668
This is why
I came and talked to you.

01:21:19.538 --> 01:21:20.868
There is absolutely nothing else.

01:21:23.768 --> 01:21:25.128
Sorry for beating you up.

01:21:36.208 --> 01:21:38.098
Where are you taking me? Teju.
Teju.

01:21:43.008 --> 01:21:45.838
They told us not to talk
to our patients' visitors.

01:21:47.628 --> 01:21:49.258
Anyway, the officer
will come tomorrow.

01:21:49.468 --> 01:21:51.288
Why should we interfere?

01:21:55.848 --> 01:21:58.828
Let's go and talk.
- No, Teju. Let's go.

01:21:58.888 --> 01:22:01.938
Come, I'll see to it.
- No, Teju, if anyone sees..

01:22:02.008 --> 01:22:03.378
Stop.
- It will be a problem.

01:22:03.518 --> 01:22:05.418
Why, sir? Are you nervous?

01:22:05.948 --> 01:22:07.358
Why do you ask, Doctor?

01:22:07.428 --> 01:22:10.258
They are my students' doctor.
Won't I be nervous?

01:22:11.468 --> 01:22:12.908
The whole of Tamil Nadu
is tense.

01:22:12.968 --> 01:22:16.358
Forget about Tamil Nadu.
It's your students who died.

01:22:16.418 --> 01:22:18.768
You should be sad first.

01:22:18.828 --> 01:22:20.708
Why are you nervous?

01:22:23.578 --> 01:22:24.298
It's okay.

01:22:24.368 --> 01:22:26.358
Did you give drugs
to your students?

01:22:26.428 --> 01:22:27.438
What?

01:22:27.858 --> 01:22:30.868
I mean, did they take drugs?

01:22:31.008 --> 01:22:34.168
That's what your reports say.
- That's what the reports say.

01:22:34.568 --> 01:22:38.078
But we don't know if they took
drugs or someone gave it to them.

01:22:38.488 --> 01:22:40.578
I don't know
what you are trying to say, Doctor.

01:22:40.898 --> 01:22:44.438
Sir, I don't think
they took drugs regularly.

01:22:45.498 --> 01:22:47.338
If so, it would have been known
in the test.

01:22:47.388 --> 01:22:48.388
Look, Doctor.

01:22:48.608 --> 01:22:50.068
I don't know anything.

01:22:50.138 --> 01:22:53.098
I came to know about drugs only
when I admitted three of them here.

01:22:54.228 --> 01:22:55.548
Talking unnecessarily.

01:22:56.958 --> 01:22:58.358
Maybe?

01:22:58.718 --> 01:23:01.048
Someone may have done this
to prevent their development.

01:23:01.268 --> 01:23:04.718
There might be other reasons like,
you asked for something.

01:23:04.788 --> 01:23:08.118
They might have refused to give it.
That's why this might have happened.

01:23:11.128 --> 01:23:13.528
As your hospital gave
the wrong medication,

01:23:13.598 --> 01:23:14.638
you are making up
stories to cover it up.

01:23:14.698 --> 01:23:15.548
Okay, then.

01:23:15.618 --> 01:23:17.148
Let it be like that.

01:23:17.408 --> 01:23:21.548
If so, we should be nervous.
Why are you nervous?

01:23:22.548 --> 01:23:26.118
-Hey, Reena? Are you nervous?
-No.

01:23:26.488 --> 01:23:28.438
See, even I am not.

01:23:29.308 --> 01:23:32.618
But when I look at you,
I can see that you are nervous.

01:23:32.798 --> 01:23:34.748
Give it to Aruna.
- Okay, madam.

01:23:36.418 --> 01:23:37.548
What are you hiding?

01:23:40.248 --> 01:23:41.258
Teju.

01:23:42.328 --> 01:23:43.328
Come here.

01:23:45.188 --> 01:23:46.188
Go, go.

01:23:50.568 --> 01:23:51.568
Ma'am.

01:23:54.038 --> 01:23:55.458
What were you talking about?

01:23:56.558 --> 01:23:58.228
Nothing, ma'am.
We were just talking.

01:23:58.298 --> 01:24:01.298
Look.
Don't do unnecessary things.

01:24:01.368 --> 01:24:03.308
The problem is
already getting worse.

01:24:03.518 --> 01:24:05.238
Be careful.

01:24:05.838 --> 01:24:07.098
I don't understand.

01:24:07.158 --> 01:24:09.198
Why are you scolding me
instead of Teju?

01:24:09.448 --> 01:24:12.518
Teju, you brought me here
and you spoke to him, right?

01:24:12.778 --> 01:24:13.888
Ma'am, I did.

01:24:14.358 --> 01:24:16.388
I am telling this to both of you.

01:24:18.158 --> 01:24:19.158
Okay, ma'am.

01:24:22.688 --> 01:24:24.818
Reena, come to the cabin.
I want to talk to you.

01:24:38.108 --> 01:24:39.428
What do you want to talk about?

01:24:40.798 --> 01:24:42.458
Did you see my father yesterday?

01:24:43.758 --> 01:24:47.538
Yes, but he came home by himself.

01:24:48.008 --> 01:24:49.118
What did he say?

01:24:49.658 --> 01:24:51.118
He said nothing.

01:24:53.598 --> 01:24:54.608
Nothing?

01:24:54.738 --> 01:24:55.738
Nope.

01:24:56.918 --> 01:24:57.928
Why?

01:24:58.298 --> 01:24:59.548
What do you want to know?

01:25:00.938 --> 01:25:05.718
No, you wanted to ask
him something, that's why I asked.

01:25:05.788 --> 01:25:07.848
If I have to ask..

01:25:07.908 --> 01:25:10.618
What else will I ask
other than our story?

01:25:11.508 --> 01:25:13.728
Did he tell you our story?
- No.

01:25:13.848 --> 01:25:18.228
Reena, tell me everything.
- Why are you asking me everything?

01:25:18.298 --> 01:25:19.628
Why don't you ask him?

01:25:19.688 --> 01:25:22.568
He didn't tell me anything.
I don't know any story.

01:25:25.928 --> 01:25:26.938
But one thing..

01:25:27.958 --> 01:25:30.228
I respect you a lot.

01:25:31.588 --> 01:25:32.588
Why?

01:25:33.018 --> 01:25:35.088
Did he tell you anything?
- No.

01:25:36.308 --> 01:25:37.458
Tell me everything.

01:25:38.268 --> 01:25:40.308
I told you
that I don't know anything.

01:25:40.378 --> 01:25:42.578
If you want to know anything,
you can go and ask him.

01:25:42.698 --> 01:25:45.128
You and your father should
spare me.

01:25:57.438 --> 01:25:58.438
Hi, senior.

01:26:01.228 --> 01:26:02.628
How is your work?

01:26:04.018 --> 01:26:05.448
All okay?

01:26:06.238 --> 01:26:07.338
What is it to me?

01:26:09.718 --> 01:26:13.568
Nothing. There is a problem going
on at the hospital.

01:26:14.188 --> 01:26:17.698
That's why I came
to ask if you are okay.

01:26:19.788 --> 01:26:21.518
The problem has been going
on for two days.

01:26:21.588 --> 01:26:23.848
Now only you came to ask about it.

01:26:24.868 --> 01:26:27.598
It's not like that, senior.
We just fought.

01:26:28.658 --> 01:26:30.258
How can I come and ask immediately?

01:26:31.048 --> 01:26:32.398
That's why I didn't ask.

01:26:32.908 --> 01:26:33.868
If you see it like that,

01:26:33.928 --> 01:26:37.588
your mother was admitted here
when we broke up.

01:26:37.748 --> 01:26:39.598
Even then I didn't come and
support you.

01:26:39.648 --> 01:26:41.978
I didn't stand there for you.
After all this,

01:26:42.048 --> 01:26:46.538
when she asked me to dance in that
problem, didn't I support her?

01:26:46.608 --> 01:26:50.038
I thought you did it as a doctor.

01:26:51.528 --> 01:26:52.558
Doctor?

01:26:53.668 --> 01:26:54.768
Doctor?

01:26:55.468 --> 01:26:57.148
You are talking like a stupid
person.

01:26:57.218 --> 01:27:01.398
The reason you didn't come to talk
to me is not because we fought.

01:27:01.658 --> 01:27:03.268
If you talk to me,

01:27:03.338 --> 01:27:05.558
you fear that they will
involve you in this case.

01:27:05.628 --> 01:27:07.528
It will spoil your career.

01:27:10.938 --> 01:27:14.638
Senior, don't talk like this.
I didn't mean it like that.

01:27:14.688 --> 01:27:17.218
You can think whatever you want.
I don't care, okay?

01:27:17.288 --> 01:27:20.238
Nobody has stood for me ever.
I don't want anybody to stand by me.

01:27:20.298 --> 01:27:23.408
Don't stand in front of me.
- Hey, A-Anitha.

01:27:24.428 --> 01:27:25.878
Go.
- Senior.

01:27:26.448 --> 01:27:29.648
I should have spoken to you.
It's my mistake

01:27:29.718 --> 01:27:30.858
Please go.

01:27:31.918 --> 01:27:32.928
Go.

01:27:58.048 --> 01:27:59.128
Hi, Arjun.

01:27:59.708 --> 01:28:00.718
Hi.

01:28:04.268 --> 01:28:07.238
The CEO is getting beaten up rapidly
by them it seems.

01:28:08.978 --> 01:28:10.008
Why, Reena?

01:28:12.868 --> 01:28:14.028
What if,

01:28:14.608 --> 01:28:19.168
like what Mr. Preetham said, I am not
the right person for this position?

01:28:19.878 --> 01:28:21.788
Don't you have faith in yourself?

01:28:21.828 --> 01:28:23.868
Why are you so self-doubtful?

01:28:23.938 --> 01:28:24.988
It's not like that, Reena.

01:28:25.768 --> 01:28:28.728
Like what he said,
I should have filed a complaint.

01:28:29.588 --> 01:28:31.258
But I didn't take that decision.

01:28:32.868 --> 01:28:36.568
I thought emotionally
instead of practically.

01:28:38.558 --> 01:28:41.828
Don't think you didn't do well
as it doesn't go well.

01:28:42.828 --> 01:28:45.058
Something will go wrong
in everyone's career.

01:28:45.338 --> 01:28:47.038
You can only learn
from your mistakes.

01:28:48.338 --> 01:28:49.348
Arjun.

01:28:49.898 --> 01:28:52.448
Instead of business,
you are seeing this as a service.

01:28:53.348 --> 01:28:55.918
You listen to the suggestions and
opinions of the workers here.

01:28:55.988 --> 01:28:57.728
And then you are coming up
with a solution.

01:28:58.938 --> 01:29:01.838
You are doing better in your job
than what you think.

01:29:02.268 --> 01:29:03.278
Don't worry.

01:29:03.478 --> 01:29:04.798
Everything will be fine tomorrow.

01:29:06.438 --> 01:29:07.438
How is that?

01:29:07.518 --> 01:29:09.098
There will be another problem
tomorrow.

01:29:09.158 --> 01:29:10.688
Then this problem will fade.

01:29:13.168 --> 01:29:14.588
That's true.

01:29:17.388 --> 01:29:18.398
Reena.

01:29:20.608 --> 01:29:22.308
Can we go out for a while?

01:29:22.808 --> 01:29:24.938
I am feeling low.

01:29:27.088 --> 01:29:29.508
You told me all this
to go out with me?

01:29:31.118 --> 01:29:32.708
No, I really wanted to talk to you.

01:29:33.118 --> 01:29:36.178
I just thought of going out.

01:29:39.838 --> 01:29:40.848
Can we go?

01:29:41.898 --> 01:29:43.108
Can we go another day?

01:29:45.058 --> 01:29:46.028
Hey.

01:29:46.098 --> 01:29:47.978
I am not saying this out of anger.

01:29:48.048 --> 01:29:51.258
I also want to come.
But I have work.

01:30:00.908 --> 01:30:03.648
Okay, Arjun. I will see you later.
I have a case to work on.

01:30:29.738 --> 01:30:30.748
What are you doing here?

01:30:30.878 --> 01:30:32.408
What are you doing here?

01:30:34.818 --> 01:30:36.218
Why are you drinking like this?

01:30:36.438 --> 01:30:37.838
I told you not to drink like this.

01:30:39.078 --> 01:30:41.728
I am calm because
I don't want to force you.

01:30:42.028 --> 01:30:44.818
But you come here everyday
after work.

01:30:46.168 --> 01:30:47.638
I know what I am doing.

01:30:50.488 --> 01:30:52.008
I feel better when I drink.

01:30:52.078 --> 01:30:55.128
Do you think I don't know
you drink at home and at the hospital?

01:30:56.158 --> 01:30:57.788
If sir was here..
- Kumar.

01:30:59.048 --> 01:30:59.848
Stop it, Kumar.

01:30:59.908 --> 01:31:01.808
If you keep saying
that if sir was here..

01:31:02.558 --> 01:31:03.628
Sir is not here.

01:31:03.758 --> 01:31:05.148
Come to the hospital and see.

01:31:05.248 --> 01:31:06.698
You will know
what I am going through.

01:31:06.768 --> 01:31:08.208
You are doing this for that?
- Yes.

01:31:08.888 --> 01:31:09.928
Like this.

01:31:10.758 --> 01:31:11.838
What do you want me to do?

01:31:13.058 --> 01:31:14.058
Go.

01:31:24.838 --> 01:31:25.838
Kumar.

01:31:26.258 --> 01:31:27.268
Sit down.

01:31:28.408 --> 01:31:30.288
It's okay. Let it be.

01:31:31.558 --> 01:31:33.268
Sit down. Come.

01:31:37.868 --> 01:31:38.868
Sorry.

01:31:43.848 --> 01:31:45.628
I can't stop it, Kumar.

01:31:45.688 --> 01:31:47.438
You can seek help to stop.

01:31:51.438 --> 01:31:52.438
Okay.

01:31:52.648 --> 01:31:53.658
I will take care.

01:31:55.148 --> 01:31:56.158
No.

01:31:56.508 --> 01:31:57.998
You are not going
to take care of it.

01:31:58.928 --> 01:32:00.628
As I know what you are doing

01:32:01.608 --> 01:32:02.778
and if you stay like this..

01:32:03.918 --> 01:32:05.028
You won't get better.

01:32:07.448 --> 01:32:08.488
Okay.

01:32:08.948 --> 01:32:09.988
What are you going to do?

01:32:10.808 --> 01:32:13.088
You should seek help.

01:32:13.818 --> 01:32:14.988
If not,

01:32:15.588 --> 01:32:17.258
I'm going to come to the hospital

01:32:17.718 --> 01:32:19.088
and then about this.

01:32:19.458 --> 01:32:20.908
And get help from them to stop you.

01:32:21.368 --> 01:32:23.118
No, no.

01:32:23.668 --> 01:32:25.698
No need for this kind of help.

01:32:31.798 --> 01:32:32.818
I'll figure it out.

01:32:34.068 --> 01:32:35.088
I will sort it out.

01:32:39.718 --> 01:32:42.448
Enough. Let's go home.

01:32:44.818 --> 01:32:45.878
Come.

01:32:46.088 --> 01:32:47.088
Come.

01:32:58.588 --> 01:33:02.488
Hey, come, come.
Where are you going?

01:33:02.558 --> 01:33:05.268
Aruna is there.
I am going to say hi.

01:33:05.798 --> 01:33:07.908
If you didn't say hi,
is her day not going to start?

01:33:08.088 --> 01:33:09.768
Don't get caught
by talking to someone.

01:33:09.838 --> 01:33:10.838
What are you saying?

01:33:12.538 --> 01:33:13.988
Volume, volume.
- What are you saying?

01:33:14.048 --> 01:33:15.548
You are not letting me
go anywhere.

01:33:15.618 --> 01:33:18.158
You should understand one thing.

01:33:18.218 --> 01:33:20.308
You came here
as a duplicate for Amaya.

01:33:20.378 --> 01:33:22.778
Can't I talk to anyone?
- Yes.

01:33:22.838 --> 01:33:24.778
Why can't you understand one thing?

01:33:24.848 --> 01:33:27.108
You are not a real nurse.

01:33:28.318 --> 01:33:29.888
You are not a real nurse?

01:33:32.938 --> 01:33:35.728
I got scared because
I thought you were a doctor.

01:33:35.908 --> 01:33:37.828
You were saying
she is not a real nurse.

01:33:37.898 --> 01:33:39.308
That's not true, sir.

01:33:39.378 --> 01:33:42.808
I will say she is not a real nurse,
she will say I'm not a real doctor.

01:33:42.878 --> 01:33:45.628
That's how we play.
You are not a real doctor? So..

01:33:45.688 --> 01:33:46.998
I am a real doctor, sir.

01:33:47.068 --> 01:33:49.538
I studied for five years
and you say I'm not a doctor.

01:33:49.608 --> 01:33:51.808
I'm working here, sir.
I swear that I'm a doctor.

01:33:51.868 --> 01:33:55.488
Sir, don't talk too much and
get caught.

01:33:55.558 --> 01:33:57.668
Who?
Who will get caught?

01:33:57.738 --> 01:34:00.418
If I don't work properly,
she will get me caught.

01:34:00.468 --> 01:34:02.388
Why are you doing comedy
during duty hours?

01:34:02.458 --> 01:34:04.438
We don't know who he is.
With so many questions..

01:34:04.508 --> 01:34:06.328
Who are you, sir?
Asking so many questions.

01:34:06.408 --> 01:34:07.778
I am Vijay.
- Vijay means?

01:34:07.908 --> 01:34:10.308
Are you the actor Vijay?

01:34:10.388 --> 01:34:12.888
No.
Dr. Vijay.

01:34:12.968 --> 01:34:15.998
I'm here to investigate
the athlete's death case.

01:34:16.068 --> 01:34:17.388
An investigative officer.

01:34:19.988 --> 01:34:22.638
Are you both involved
in the athlete's death case?

01:34:22.648 --> 01:34:25.378
No, sir.
We don't know anything.

01:34:25.438 --> 01:34:27.508
I am an innocent doctor.
She is an innocent nurse.

01:34:27.578 --> 01:34:30.168
Trust us.
You can ask anyone.

01:34:30.348 --> 01:34:33.308
I'll try to believe you.
Where is the CEO's office?

01:34:33.678 --> 01:34:35.548
CEO office?

01:34:37.068 --> 01:34:41.888
Go to the right. Hey, tell him.
- Sir, go that way.

01:34:42.558 --> 01:34:43.608
That's right, sir.

01:34:43.908 --> 01:34:45.058
Dr. Radhi is there?

01:34:45.778 --> 01:34:50.498
Radhi ma'am has night shift.
It's time for her to go home.

01:34:50.928 --> 01:34:52.538
She is leaving.

01:34:58.108 --> 01:34:59.118
Radhi.

01:35:19.348 --> 01:35:20.438
Do you remember me?

01:35:21.838 --> 01:35:23.058
Of course, you remember.

01:35:24.568 --> 01:35:27.878
You look the same.
As I have seen you in school.

01:35:28.398 --> 01:35:29.408
You look the same.

